DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "What's the best way to record your mistakes so you don't repeat them again?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh that\'s an important question!  I\'m not sure if I have an answer, but what I can tell you is that just taking a look at what your "mistakes" are might be helpful.  For instance, maybe you\'re saying you should start this discussion over from the beginning.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't understand what you were saying. I need to remember my mistakes so I don't repeat them, but how?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That's a good question!  One idea that might be useful is that you could keep a record of your mistakes, so you can look at them later and make sure you don't repeat them."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes and I want to know how do you record the mistakes for review later.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It\'s a good idea to write them down.  Maybe you could just make a list of mistakes?  Like a checklist or a "to do list"?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What else can you think of?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You could write them in a diary or diary app that you could look back at later.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What about about an audio recording?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, that\'s another good idea!  One possible way of doing this is with a program called "Evernote".  This way you can record an audio note, and you could review it later.  You could even look at notes from previous conversations.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay, I think that's enough. Thank you."}]
