DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you know what are harmful things one should not throw away? I know one of them are batteries'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Did you mean to ask for a “list of things one should not throw away”?  Or did you mean to ask if I know which objects are actually harmful?  (I think the “harmful” one is the ones that you should not put into the landfill, like batteries, disposable razors, and things like that.)'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm asking what are things one cannot dispose of at the landfill"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, it’s illegal to throw away batteries and disposable razors.  For things that you really should throw away, it really depends on the place.  You could have a look online and see what sorts of rules each place has for disposal, and whether it’s illegal to throw out something else.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'You can totally dispose of razors, so thats wrong'}]
