ourse.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'of course.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s what I’d prefer.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'ok. sounds good to me. I like iced normally. however, in the morning I typically have hot coffee.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’d like hot coffee.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Would you like some flavoring in your coffee?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, I would like something like cinnamon.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'ok.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It would add a nice flavor.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Cinnamon is a good flavor.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s a very good flavor.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you like pastries with your coffee?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think I would like a pastry.  It would be good to have with coffee.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'what kind of pastry would you prefer?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I like chocolate and pecan.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'That sounds good.'}]
