DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I like to host guests at my home from time to time, and I am gathering  recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Sicilian dishes. Can you give me a recipe for Escarole Siciliano?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This is a good place to start, from Italian Cooking for Gourmet Men by Ilaria Gozzini Giacosa:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is it possible to omit the butter. I am vegan.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It looks like the butter is just to add more richness to the dish, if you don’t need that and don’t want to use animal products, you could try cooking it in olive oil or maybe some other oil with flavor, like safflower. I could also be honest and say I’m not sure how well the dish would come out, but I’d be willing to try experimenting!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, I think I will try avocado oil to replace the butter. Avocado oil has a distinct flavor.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to learn how to make chocolate fudge, can you help me with that?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure! I would suggest that you begin by following the directions in a fudge recipe. You can also try a search on Google, and then you can check out the videos and see what you think. Do you want to try and make the fudge from scratch?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes I would like to make fudge from scratch.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Okay, I can tell you how to do that. There’s a good fudge recipe here, but that one will take almost all day to make and freeze the fudge and then take it out of the freezer.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Could you walk me through the steps?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure. First, you want to cook some milk and sugar on the stove until it begins to turn golden, about 300 degrees Fahrenheit (150 C). Then you’ll want to pour it into a large bowl, and let it cool completely before you put in the chocolate chips and cream.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the next step in the process?'}]
