DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Big band music has been on my mind. Any bands or big band songs you can recommend?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well big band music is music that is made up of a lot of instruments, like a trumpet, a trombone, a saxophone, a clarinet, etc. And also there are a lot of people playing the instruments. This kind of music was popular in the United States from about the 1920’s to the 1940’s, and the big band that was the most famous of those was the Glenn Miller Orchestra, who wrote some really good songs like “In the Mood” and “String of Pearls”. But there’s a lot of other bands from that time period who made a lot of good music too, so we could look at that and find some examples.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Glenn Miller sounds familiar. I remember dancing to him!'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s a great example of a big band music style. Some other bands from that time period were Guy Lombardo and His Royal Canadians, Louis Armstrong, and Duke Ellington.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Louis Armstrong! Did he play the trumpet?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I just moved into a new house and we don't have a mailbox. Can people still deliver mail?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Generally yes, most companies will deliver mail to your house, assuming it’s easy to find. If you can have someone hold a sign up to the front door, that works, or even just write your address on a card and tape it to the front door.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "We've gotten UPS and Fedex packages, but USPS has a problem delivering mail without a mailbox. How can I remedy this problem?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "USPS doesn't have the same easy options as Fedex and UPS. If you have an object outside your door that someone can hold a sign up to, that would also help. Or USPS can deliver your mail to a nearby Post Office. Here's a service called Your Delivery Service that says it has a free service to help you with all of this: https://my.usps.com/store/Catalog/Delivery/DeliveryServices.htm"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can I get a PO Box at the local post office for deliveries?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I make a pumpkin pie for Thanksgiving dinner?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'We can easily make a pumpkin pie!  We’ll use your kitchen and its tools to make a lovely pumpkin pie!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Great. Do you have a recipe I can follow thats simple to do?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Why don't other countries have the same game as American Football?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s just a sports game, so it’s a cultural matter.  Countries have different national pastimes and customs.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'But baseball and cricket have exported really well?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'how can i relocate a bee hive?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are two basic ways to move a bee hive, the more time-consuming and riskier is to move the hive body, the top part of the hive that contains the comb and brood.  It’s called “supering” the hive, and it’s done by putting a sheet of plywood or something similar on top of the hive body, then just sliding the whole thing to its new location.  This is dangerous because it is easy for bees to fly into the super, and since the bees get less oxygen inside the super, it can be difficult for them to stay alive during the move.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, thanks. Any other advice?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s best to place the new box a bit further away from other houses and places people might be visiting, because bees are territorial and will defend their hive from intruders.  Moving the new box closer to an area with people might lead to bees trying to defend the box against humans.  If you have to place the box next to a building, you could either cover it with a piece of cloth that does not block the entrance hole, or you can install screens that don’t go all the way to the ground on the side of the box that’s nearest the building.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'All right, thanks.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How should I stay safe if going to an indoor environment during covid?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s a great question.  We’ve actually thought a lot about how to protect people who have to go to crowded indoor spaces during the covid pandemic.  There are three main ways of reducing the spread of covid: social distancing, handwashing, and wearing masks.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay but I need to go to the supermarket.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, we understand that.  You also need to eat.  When it comes to working out a safe plan, it’s important to understand that there are three main ways covid is spreading.  That includes personal transmission, direct contact, and airborne spread.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'All right, any other advice?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I prevent split ends?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Split ends are a normal part of hair growth. When hair grows longer, a new layer of skin called a “cuticle” is exposed and then split.  Here are some ways to prevent split ends:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is a diffuser?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A diffuser is a tool that reduces the amount of heat applied to your hair when blow drying.  Most hair dryers have a diffuser attachment.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I do not think that most do'}]
