DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do you change the background in photoshop?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can open up the background layer, and then change the options for the background color, pattern, or gradient.  Can you tell me what you want to do, and I can walk you through that.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to take a person in a picture and place them at a different location.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'To change the location of someone in the picture, you first need to select them, then you can move them to wherever you like.  If you click the person in the image, a selection tool will appear.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What does it look like?'}]
