DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I get my dog used to travel?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'How would you feel about putting your dog in a cage and driving them around?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I would rather him be able to roam around freely int he backseat.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Can you help your dog get comfortable with traveling? Do you know where he is safest, and what might make him less comfortable?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'This is why I am asking you.  I need tips on how to make him comfortable.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'When you are on long trips with your dog, do you let him roam around?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Not too long, like an hour.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'How about you put his bed in the car, or use a cat carrier?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The bed is a great idea!  I never thought of that!  Thanks!'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Or even better, if you just take the bed and make sure to have a leash on him, so you can keep an eye on him?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I can do that, too!  Thanks for the help!'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I paint rocks for decorations?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Painting rocks can be done a number of different ways.  One approach is to prepare the surface by sanding or washing it, as you would with a painting.  You could also scrape away any loose surface material and then fill the resulting cavities with a glaze of acrylic paint.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What kind of paint should I use?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are many kinds of paint.  Two common kinds of paint used for this type of project are house paint and oil paint.  House paint is a mix of water and fine-particle mineral pigment.  Oil paint is similar, but with oils instead of water.  Both types of paint are common and affordable, and both are easy to use, but there are other types of paint available if you prefer something different.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How long does it take for paint to dry on a rock?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I be more confident?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can try talking to yourself and putting yourself in a supportive mental state, and then imagine you’re doing your thing and reaching out for your dreams and accomplishing them.  This can help you imagine yourself in your future self, and be able to remember your goals and values.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay I'll try to have a more positive mindset and I'll focus on my goals."}]
