d in weight loss. Let’s go through some of the most popular ones:\n\n---\n\n### **1. Squats**\n- **What it does**: Builds lower body strength, improves balance, and boosts metabolism.\n- **How to do it**: \n  - Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, toes slightly pointed.\n  - Lower your hips toward the floor, keeping your knees ahead of your toes.\n  - Push up to stand tall, then lower yourself again.\n- **Variations**: Bodyweight Squats, Squat Jumps, Wall Sit, Jump Squats.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Deadlifts (Bodyweight)**\n- **What it does**: Targets the lower back, glutes, and hamstrings.\n- **How to do it**: \n  - Stand"]
