DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What kind of socks do you think would keep my feet most warm'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'For a man, I’d recommend wool socks.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Alright, do you have any particular brands that are high quality and a reasonable price?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'No I don’t really know anything about socks. I’m not a footwear expert.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, is there anything about wool I should know?  Will it make my feet itch?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Wool can feel scratchy and itchy, especially for people with sensitive skin.  However, most people don’t notice it as much when they’re wearing socks.  They just wear them for the extra warmth.  Wool is also supposed to be better for your feet in general.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Alright so you think as I'm focused on the warmth not the itch I should be fine?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do car transmissions work?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Did you mean to type “Cars” instead of “Car”? \nYou can think of it like this:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "How do different gears work inside of the car's transmission?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Each gear moves a piston that pushes against the engine, and uses the energy of that push to rotate the wheels and cause the car to move.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Why do some transmissions have more gears than others?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Some transmissions have higher numbers of gears, and some don't.  More gears are helpful for more complicated situations.  For example, imagine you were trying to drive up a steep hill.  If your car only had three gears, then when you tried to move up the hill you would have to accelerate the engine slowly, which uses a lot of fuel, and causes the car to shake.  If your car had five gears, you could choose a gear that is low enough to just get you started, then shift into a higher gear that you could stay in for a while until you were at the top of the hill."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the maximum numbers of gears a transmission can have?'}]
