DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are the rules of the card game solitaire?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What are you looking for? There are many variants of solitaire that have slightly different rules. There are different “plays” of solitaire, so you could be looking for the “grandfather play” of solitaire.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you give me the rules of the most common way of playing the game solitaire?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Ok, I found the official rules for the game of solitaire. The name of the game comes from the French word “solitaire”, which means “alone” or “solitary”. The object of the game is to arrange a complete sequence of cards, one in each row, column, or diagonal in a game grid, using cards from your hand.  In a standard game of solitaire, there are fifty-two cards.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I set up the game solitaire? What is the point of the game?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Solitaire is played with one deck of 52 cards. This is a different setup from the “regular” game of solitaire.  The point of the game is to arrange the deck in order to have all the cards visible from your hand. There are multiple ways to play, depending on the “play” that you want to try.  Many games are of the “Patience” variety.  Other games are based on completing a pattern. Some games start with certain cards “wild”.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What cards could be seen as "wild"?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some things I can do in Monterrey, Mexico?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s a good question! You could spend time enjoying some of the fantastic local restaurants, or shopping for gifts or food to take back home.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'any specific tourist spots?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Monterrey is the business center of Mexico, and as such it’s a bit of a mix of modern cities and traditional Mexican villages. There are several incredible museums that showcase important aspects of Mexican culture, including the Royal Museum of Anthropology and History and the National Museum of Anthropology. The area is also home to a large variety of parks, forests, and other natural spaces that you can enjoy during your visit.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't think those places are in Monterrey."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you interested in other types of activities during your trip? You could go to the nearby town of Linares, which is home to incredible wildlife and very historic villages. Or you could do some fun hiking in the mountains of Monterrey.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I thought that was an industrial park.'}]
