DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is a yeast infection?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yeast infections are a type of infection in the vagina. They’re caused by the yeast Candida albicans. Yeast infections in the vagina are often very uncomfortable. They can cause itching, burning, and discharge. People who have yeast infections often say that it feels like a “crab-like” or “creepy” sensation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How are they treated?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are some common over-the-counter treatments available. For yeast infections in the vagina you can use Monistat 7 Cream. You should take it internally and put it on the affected area. You can buy it from a local pharmacy or by calling 1-800-633-8927. Or you can use Refil-Again, which you should also take internally and apply to the affected area. This drug is available at many local pharmacies. The sooner you begin treatment, the more quickly it will work.  For yeast infections of the penis, there are a number of different treatments available. One is the over-the-counter medicine Suppository that you apply to the affected area. Another is an oral medication called Vagistat, which is available at many local pharmacies.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Ok thank you for the great information.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I train myself to be a more focused person?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are a lot of different techniques to improve focus. A mindfulness practice, for instance, would ask you to be more attentive to your inner states as you go about your day.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Which techniques have proven to be most helpful in improving focus?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It depends on what you’re trying to accomplish. If you’re trying to accomplish something, like finishing a paper or getting to a meeting on time, then that will depend on your personal priorities. On the other hand, if you’re trying to develop yourself as a person, then mindfulness is a good way to go.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you explain the mindfulness technique to focus more, please?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure. When you’re mindful, you’re paying attention to yourself and your surroundings in a way that you wouldn’t normally, and noticing how that makes you feel. You could sit in a quiet room, with eyes closed, breathing deeply. That’s very simple.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'If I am understanding correctly, I could become a more focused person if I pay attention to my thinking process and habits?'}]
