DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I learn to swim?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A wise person might tell you that you should put aside time to study technique before doing many laps.  Swimming is actually a very precise art, and there are principles and techniques that, when learned, will make the swimmer more efficient and capable of greater distances.  You can learn these principles with instruction and drill practice, which you could spend the time for now or even later, if you want to give it a try.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I learn to swim fast'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m sure there are good books on swimming training and technique, and also coaches who would teach you this.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Any books you can reccomend?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I remove a wasp nest?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you saying you want to get rid of the wasps, or the nest itself?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Both hopefully!'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I suggest spraying them with poisonous insecticide.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can  you recommend a good product that does this?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Just spray the whole nest, which is composed of paper and other organic matter that the wasps have gathered for use in their nest.  The most effective chemicals are known as ‘Systemic Insecticides’ which are highly toxic to insects and tend to spread through a colony once they are dispersed.  The ones I know about include: Permethrin, Cypermethrin, Pyrethrins, and Picaridin.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks a lot, I will look into this when I go shopping.'}]
