y units can conduct operations independently in most regions of the world. They have also demonstrated that they can effectively perform sustained power projection at the air and sea level of warfare, with battalion-sized elements, in large-scale operations.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'This explanation sounds better and clearer, in my opinion.  I found this information online "The U.S. Marine Corps falls under the Department of the Navy; however its command structure is similar to the Army’s,"'}]
