now affects the leaves and bark.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Water Features**\n- **Rivers and Streams:**\n  - **Flow Patterns:** Capture the rhythm of water moving through a river or stream.\n  - **Beds and Banks:** Sketch the texture of the riverbed', "</think>\n\nYes, they do. Catering requires a variety of skills, including:\n\n1. **Cooking and Baking**: They need to know how to prepare a wide range of foods, from simple snacks to complex dishes.\n2. **Nutrition and Dietary Restrictions**: Caterers must be able to accommodate special diets, like vegetarian, vegan, or gluten-free.\n3. **Presentation**: They need to make sure the food is visually appealing to attract guests.\n4. **Time Management**: Events are often time-sensitive, and they must plan and execute everything efficiently.\n5. **Communication**: They must work with event planners, hosts, and guests to understand their needs and preferences.\n6. **Teamwork**: Catering is a team effort, involving chefs, servers, and support staff.\n\nEven though they don't need to be a master chef, they should have a good understanding of food, a friendly attitude, and the ability to work well with others. Many caterers also learn to cook"]
