nate** like a drum. It's a subtle, firm sound, not too bouncy or too soft.\n\n### Why this sound matters:\n- If the tortilla is too soft (and maybe a little undercooked), it might be too floppy and break when you flip it.\n- If it's too dry (and overcooked), it might be tough and not as soft.\n\n### Tips"]
