DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I make a simple omelet?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you mean a really plain omelet, with just egg, salt, and cheese?  That can be done with any egg beater, but you can also buy an omelet pan which is designed specifically for that.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think I just whip up the eggs and cook them with cheese and other things inside.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I know you can use an egg ring to make a crepe, and an omelet pan to make an omelet.  However, if you want to make a simple omelet without much fancy stuff you can just use an ordinary pan, and carefully stir the eggs while heating the pan, or you can try to heat the pan without oil, then add the eggs and quickly stir them, and then cook them.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some things I can add to the omelet besides cheese?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are different golf clubs used for?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A golfer’s bag includes fourteen clubs for each player, from a driver to a putter, but there are different reasons for choosing each club.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What are those different reasons?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A driver is used to hit the ball the farthest, for people who like to hit the ball straight and far away.  A fairway wood is used to hit the ball through the air, to help a player get to the green.  A hybrid club is used to hit the ball from different areas of the fairway.  A putter is used to hit the ball the shortest distance into the hole, to help a player get the ball into the cup.  And a wedge is used to hit the ball in between the green and the hole, to help a player come close to the hole.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are the clubs with numbers on them?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Each of the clubs has a “loft” measurement, which is the angle of the clubface when it is at rest.  These measurements increase from number one to number five.  The smallest club, the one with the smallest loft, is a one-iron.  The next one, the two-iron, has a slightly larger loft, and so on.  The club with the largest loft is called the five-iron, or a driver, because it has a loft about one-and-a-half times as large as that of the four-iron.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are those one to five numbered clubs used for?'}]
