DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I know if my parent has dementia?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'If you can understand your parent, and they answer your questions coherently and remember things you’ve talked about in the past, they probably don’t have dementia.  But dementia can start with problems with memory, so it’s always a good idea to keep asking questions, and to also notice how their behavior is changing.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Any other advice?'}]
