DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is a good family dog?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m sure there are many good family dogs. It depends on what you like and how much time and energy you’re willing to put into a dog’s needs and training.  Some of the best family dogs have been of large sizes like golden retrievers, labs, German shepherds, and other breeds.  Some smaller dogs, like the terrier and chihuahua type dogs, have also been very good pets.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, I thought chihuahuas were kind of stubborn.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'They are.  The problem with these tiny little dogs is that they’re also sometimes quite yappy.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yeah, so what other kinds would you recommend? I like the idea of Golden Retrievers and Labs and German Shepherds.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There’s a couple of very good options: Huskies and Australian Shepherds are both medium-sized, active dogs that make great family pets, or if you prefer a non-shepherd dog I would suggest a retriever.  The Great Pyrenees is a large breed that’s very friendly and calm, and I recommend that for those that want a calm family dog.  The Newfoundland is another good option as it’s very large and can grow up to 125 pounds but is very friendly and gentle.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Those are great suggestions. Which is your favorite?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is Les Misérables?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The novel “Les Misérables” by Victor Hugo is set in France in the 19th century, and tells the story of Jean Valjean. Valjean is convicted of stealing a loaf of bread and is sent to prison, but after his release, he begins a new life. The story follows him as he grows in empathy and kindness, and eventually comes to terms with his past.  It has also inspired two musicals, which were very popular in the 1970s.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I thought it played on Broadway a long time ago.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, it did.  Actually, the most popular adaptation of the story was an adaptation of the musical version by a different author.  I’m not sure what the plot of that was, but I can tell you about the musical if you’d like.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, please tell me more about it.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Les Misérables is the story of Jean Valjean, an ex-convict. He was released from prison after serving nineteen years, but upon being released was tracked by the police, who thought he had stolen a loaf of bread and was attempting to flee the city.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Was the play in English?'}]
