DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you think using Social Media is a good idea?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m afraid I’m not really qualified to answer that question. How can I best help you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm just wondering whether you would recommend people use Social Media on a regular basis?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "It's an interesting question, and I think it's important that you learn about how Social Media is used in the world today.  It's a tricky topic because people have different motivations and goals when they use Social Media.  I recommend you check out some of these related questions: \n[Editing this to add some info]\nHow are people using social media?\nAre people on social media more or less happy than people who are not?\nIs there any way to use social media without feeling bad about yourself?\nWould you benefit from using social media? \nDo you worry about the dangers of social media?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks, these are some interesting questions. It seems it can be difficult to truly connect on social media.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "It is definitely tricky to connect with people online.  But I'm sure you'll have a great time interacting with people who share similar interests."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's right. It just can be difficult to maintain relationships with people in difference countries, who have similar interests."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I think that's a good idea, to keep a healthy distance with people with different nationalities.  In general, you should avoid close relationships with people you can’t meet in person.  Would you like me to tell you about some ideas for managing friendships online?  You can also let me know if you have any other questions!"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, can you tell me some more about managing friendships online?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m happy to.  Many people use the word “friendship” to describe their online relationships, but many of them are more like casual acquaintances.  I’m curious if you’re interested in more than just casual acquaintances?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Ah, that's maybe where I'm going wrong, making that distinction between casual acquaintance and close friendship."}]
