DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'It helps me to have a positive clear image of where I want to be in the next few years. Can you help me conceive of a better life for myself? Some info about me: I’m an academic. I live in California but I miss my family. I have a dog and a husband.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hm, you asked me for help with imagining a more ideal life.  Can you start by telling me a bit more about yourself?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I need a lot of intellectual stimulation and sociality, but I have specific needs for my friends. I like to read, hike, and see new places.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think we’re making progress. Can you describe some good times you’ve had, and also some bad times that have helped you learn and grow?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I had good times in school—high school, college—with communities that remained stable and structured my days. I had good weekend activities with my husband early in grad school, and good international trips with him too. My bad times have been anxious, depressive, introverted, self-critical, and lonely.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hm, I’m getting a sense of what a good life for you would be.  Have you considered hiring a personal trainer? Or a life coach?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I have a therapist, but I don’t really want a personal trainer.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you open to changing your lifestyle? What would you be willing to change to move toward a better life for yourself?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yeah, I think I should spend less time at home. I’m not always sure what that means for me. I go into the office more. Maybe I see some friends more, one on one. Maybe I throw a party.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'And how about the habits you have? Could you imagine yourself exercising more, for example?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I guess so. I also want to meditate more.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you hep me with a cocktail recipe that contains coffee?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I can help with that! What kind of cocktail do you want?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Just any that has a coffee flavor to it'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, you can definitely get the flavor of coffee in some cocktails, like a White Russian or a Black Russian.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay what is the difference between those two?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'They both use coffee liquor, but a White Russian is mixed with cream and a shot of vodka, whereas a Black Russian is made with heavy cream and Kahlua.  So it’s really a difference between whether you use cream or an iced coffee liqueur.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Ohhh, I think I may go with the white russian. Okay can you tell me all the ingredients for a white russian?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure!  I would start by putting the coffee liqueur into your cocktail shaker with ice cubes.  Then I would pour in some vodka and whisk it up.  Then I would pour in cream, and whip it up again with my whisk.  \nLastly I would strain the drink through a sieve or a coffee filter, and pour it into a glass.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Easy, thank you'}]
