DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I play darts and what are the rules?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Darts is a game where players throw arrows or darts into a circular board. It is considered a sport with specific rules.  Rules are the things players follow during a game to make it fair and interesting.  Rules include what a person is allowed to do, how to tell if a player’s score is valid, and when the game stops.  \nDarts is a kind of game called a precision sport.  In these kinds of games, players try to hit small targets or lines on a board with small objects, like darts or arrows. \nDarts uses the darts board, and darts are also called arrows or darts.  These are small pointed things you use to throw.\nDarts board has two sections with circular tracks.  It is scored in a numerical system of 180.  You throw the darts at a target on the board.  If it hits the target, you get points, and the value of the point depends on where you hit the target.\nOne dart board and darts are used to play a game.  Most darts boards have a throwing line or throwing space.  You throw from your side of the line and hit the targets on the board.\nYou use a flat'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How many darts do you throw when its your turn?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The rules are different depending on what type of game you are playing.  Some dart boards are shot out of order, which means that the players take turns, but sometimes each player gets to throw a set number of darts.  Other dart boards are tournament style, and you play in rounds.  In these rounds you get to throw all of your darts.  To make it fair, you only get to throw the darts you earned in a turn.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think the game of darts I am thinking of has 3 darts and you count down from 300 or some other number.'}]
