DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is Business Administration a good career?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Business Administration is a general term for all of the skills and responsibilities that are used in running a business, or one specific business. It’s a broad field that spans various industries. A bachelor’s degree in business administration usually requires a broad education in business finance, business law, marketing, operations, management, and organizational psychology, so it provides the broad range of skills that are necessary in the management of a business. It also includes understanding the legal and regulatory frameworks within which business activities are organized. Does that answer your question?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So it would be good to learn if you are going to open a business?'}]
