DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Should you leave cookies out for Santa?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s an interesting question, I’ll give you a concrete answer, but first I want to ask why you’re thinking about this?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The kids are asking me.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Ah, the kids are asking you, I get it!  This is a tricky question.  My feeling is that if you want to be as nice as possible to Santa, and you’re also trying to avoid tempting bad behavior by the kids, you should leave some cookies out.  But I don’t think it’s a good idea to leave cookies out as an automatic “always” situation.  When you really care about the kids, and you want to be careful with how they’re raised, leaving cookies out is a nice gesture but also an easy trigger for bad behavior.  Kids who are used to having the house filled with cookies for Santa are less likely to have a “bad” reaction to receiving cookies, because they’re more “used to it”.  This is not to say you should never leave out cookies, but it’s good to put a little thought into when and where you’d do it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Ok thank you.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I left the car in the parking lot to get some grocery. When I came back to finally get home, for some reason I'm no longer able to get the car to start. Can you help?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Let’s think about this. Do you remember any mechanical failure at all? Are there any burnt smelling things, or anything related to the motor?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "No, I don't remember anything. It just suddenly happened. Before this, the car was running fine."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Very well. Then I think we should do some tests. First, try to disconnect the battery. Try to start the car without the battery. If it's still not working, try to connect the battery again and try again."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Sorry, I missed to mention that it's an automatic, so I don't think disconnecting the battery will allow us to even start the car."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That's OK. We can try it anyway. It's certainly possible the battery still has some charge and we can test it this way."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "OK. I've tried disconnecting it, then starting the car which as expected didn't turn things on. Then I've reconnected the battery and tried starting the car again to no avail."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I think the next thing to try is to open the hood and see what's inside. I'd say, go ahead and start trying to figure out what's going on. I'll be here to help, and I can definitely help you troubleshoot this."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Thanks. I've checked under the hood but not exactly sure which I should be looking at. Everything seems normal."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That's okay, we can go one by one. Go ahead and look for the alternator. It's usually a grey box under the battery."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What do I do with it?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm wondering if the viola might be an instrument to explore. Can you make a living, playing a viola?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I can definitely make a living teaching music, and there are people who’ve done it all their lives as composers and musicians, as well as people who play the viola in orchestras.  \nI don’t know much about how well violas are paid in major orchestras though.  I think that orchestras try to keep that information confidential, so as not to tip off potential job candidates.  If you want to be an orchestral musician and you go after a major orchestra job, you’ll have to do some research into what a salary might be in that position, and see if you can afford it'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sounds like a few good observations.  Are there any famous viola players?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Why are some people allergic to peanuts?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not a doctor, but I’m guessing it has something to do with your immune system, and the histamine in your body, and when you have a reaction it’s an allergic reaction.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'could you explain a little more?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, you’re kind of right, the immune system is important in allergies, but this time it’s about your body’s response to the peanut proteins.  Peanuts contain proteins and it’s possible for some people’s bodies to react to those proteins and cause an allergic response.   So in a way, it’s a response from your immune system, but it’s not so much an allergic response, it’s more of an autoimmune response.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to visit New Zealand.  Please tell me about it.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'New Zealand is a fascinating place.  Its beautiful landscapes, unique flora and fauna, a safe and welcoming country, and some of the most attractive beaches in the world.  The friendly locals are also noted for their hospitality and generosity.  It is also home to several indigenous tribes, each with its own distinctive culture.  The economy is currently growing rapidly and while the population density is relatively low, this gives the country a stunning quality of life.  Finally, the country has a thriving hospitality industry with many options for activities, from diving to kite surfing, hiking, rafting, skiing, fishing, and more.  If you are looking for the perfect vacation getaway, New Zealand should be top of your list.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Which one is more fascinating, Australia or New Zealand?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Both are fascinating countries in their own unique ways.  But if you had to choose, I’d recommend New Zealand.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What languages are spoken in New Zealand?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What to write in a card to cheer someone up?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s more helpful to me to understand the context of the question.  Are they currently in a period of distress, and you want to write a card to offer support or encouragement, or is the situation more positive, and you just want to send them a card with an uplifting message?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'They are sad because their dog passed away. I want to cheer them up.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you looking for a way to cheer them up right now, or just generally encourage them? If they have a dog, you might encourage them to get a new dog, or encourage them to reach out to friends and relatives, to have people around to help take care of them.  You could write a card to let them know that you’re thinking about them, or to just say that you want them to know that you’re there for them.  I could help you to write the specific words and sentences you could say.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'That would be great.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, let’s talk through the specifics of what we might write.  We might start by simply telling them that you hope they’re doing ok, and that they’re in your thoughts.  We could talk about how your relationship is, and share some specific feelings you have.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'That sounds good.'}]
