DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Would you explain to me how measles are spread from human to human?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I have two main ideas.  First, I could explain to you that if a human has measles, he or she is contagious from about four days before any symptoms are visible until the fourth day after the last visible symptom, which is known as the incubation period.  So when someone is contagious, they may spread the virus to other humans who have never had it before.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Now can you explain HOW it is spread.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure. The virus can live on surfaces for up to two hours.  It spreads through the air by droplets.  So when people talk or sneeze, small droplets of fluid containing the virus spread in the air.  These droplets travel around 2 meters (about 6 feet) and if they touch the nose, mouth or eyes, they can infect a person.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, so like many other viruses and whatnot'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I take care of succulent plants?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I can help!  Succulent plants are ones that aren’t too water-sensitive, which means that if you overwater them they’ll survive, but they won’t thrive.  In other words, you can overwater them a little bit, but they won’t come out of it as well as if they’d been watered carefully.  Watered carefully is actually pretty easy in the “hanging basket” model, which is the best model for growing most succulents.  I recommend a two-tier watering system, where the top watering level is only a quarter-inch.  Any deeper and the roots dry out.  And you can grow them in partial shade.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How long do succulents live?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, some species can live upwards of twenty years.  Succulents can survive extreme cold, but they shouldn’t be exposed to direct sunlight in the winter.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Wow, interesting.  Thanks for the information!'}]
