DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I find myself feeling tired during the day, and I feel like I'm not getting enough sleep at night. Can you help me find ways to get more sleep?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "You said that you find yourself feeling tired during the day and that you don't think you're getting enough sleep at night. It might help to examine your life and habits and compare it with what you think will help you. Let me ask you a couple of questions about your routine, and we can talk about what you can do to help with getting more sleep."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, what questions do you have for me?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Okay, I have a list of things I'd like to ask you about.  You can either answer all of them, or just answer what you think is relevant, or ignore my questions if you don't feel comfortable."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, ask me.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you happy with how you spend your day?  What time do you get up in the morning, and what time do you go to sleep at night?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Not really. I have to wake up very early to commute for work, and I get home pretty late. I hardly have any free time after that, and I still feel like I'm going to bed too late."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I can help you think through ways you can adjust your schedule to make it better, but I want to check first that you're happy with it."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm not happy with it. How can you help?"}]
