ryptocurrency.\n\nSo, to answer your question directly: **Bitcoin was first developed in 2008**.\n\nBut here\'s a fun fact: The first Bitcoin block, known as "block 0," was mined on **10 January 2009**. That\'s the first block of the first Bitcoin blockchain.\n\nLet me know if you\'d like to learn more about the history, technology, or how it works!']
