DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to go to Greece.  Does it have historical sites?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, absolutely.  Greek culture is particularly important to understanding history and literature and religion.  If you want to learn more about Greece you can look up the city of Athens, which is one of the most important centers of human cultural development in Europe.  There are a lot of other important places to visit, as well.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What sites would you suggest for me to visit first?  I will only be on vacation for two weeks.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hm.  That’s a very short time to spend.  I would suggest starting with the Acropolis, which is an ancient fortification atop a hill.  This was built by the Athenians to commemorate a victory over the Persians, in 480 BCE.  You might also want to see the Parthenon, which is a famous temple dedicated to the goddess Athena.  It was built on the acropolis sometime in the fifth century BCE.  I would also suggest seeing the Temple of Zeus at Olympia, which is a prominent place of worship.  In addition, the Archaeological Museum is a great place to see statues and historical objects.  If you’re interested in archeology, you might want to visit the Diolkos, an important ancient pathway along the waterfront.  For a special treat, you can also go to one of the beaches on the Aegean Sea.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Should I rent a car to visit the sites?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you offer a guide for improving my mental health, particularly depression?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hmm, that’s a pretty big question, and not something I could really help with.  I think you might get better if you tried to:  Get out more and meet new people, Exercise daily, Take Prozac or Paxil, and Read fiction.  Can you tell me more about your current mental state and why you’re asking me this?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks for the suggestions. Actually can you just give me a guide for daily activities to improve with depression?'}]
