DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I prepare for my first time skydiving?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think the first step is deciding when you’ll do it, and if it’s something you’re ready to commit to.  Are you doing it for fun?  Or as a sort of gift to yourself or something?  I recommend trying to come up with a set of goals, and then think about how you could test and measure if you met those goals.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I am doing it with a group of friends. I'm sort of nervous, but I know it will be an amazing experience."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great!  If you’re with friends, it might be good to talk about what you want out of the experience, and think about the best way to make sure you’re prepared and do it right.  Have you checked your insurance, and what gear you’ll need?  Will you be jumping out of a plane, or helicopter?   Which ones are best for training?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'All I know is that we are jumping out of a plane. That is why I came to you for advice.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to scale Mount Everest. What steps should I take to prepare myself?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, wow! That’s a really intense, long-term goal! I’m not sure exactly what you mean by “preparation” for that, but it could definitely be helpful to spend some time on aerobic exercise. How long do you think you have before you’ll try the climb?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Aerobic exercise is definitely a good idea. I think I want to do it within the next year. What types of exercise should I do?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would recommend jogging, because it’s good for all of the body, and I’m familiar with jogging myself, so I could run with you and make sure that you’re doing it safely.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, thank you! Is there any other type of exercise besides jogging you would recommend I do to prepare?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would also recommend yoga, or swimming, or riding a bike. Any of those are good for the whole body.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Should I practice exercising with weights on my back? When I'm scaling Everest I will be carrying a lot of gear"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m afraid I don’t have experience with weightlifting, so I can’t give you specific advice on that. But it seems like it would be good for your general fitness to be as strong as possible in your arms and legs, so I think doing some weightlifting would be good for you.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What type of gear will I need in order to properly climb Mount Everest?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Um, well you’ll definitely need warm clothes, for sure! I don’t know if you can find mountaineering equipment on Amazon, but that would be the best place to look, I think. You will also definitely need some kind of rope or device to keep you from falling off the edge of the mountain, I think. I can’t really tell you more, because I don’t know very much about mountaineering. I’m sorry I can’t be more helpful.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Will I need to bring an oxygen tank?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s hard to tell, because I’m not an expert, but I would guess that if you’re climbing so high up that you need to use oxygen tanks, then it probably isn’t a good idea for you to climb it alone. Have you heard of any organizations that you could climb with?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, I have climbing partners. How long does it typically take someone to climb Mount Everest?'}]
