DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Hello, I am trying to find out how to take care of a Chinchilla. Can you help me?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, so you’ve got a Chinchilla? Chinchillas are cute animals that look kind of like rodents and have a long furry tail. They’re really interesting, though. What exactly do you need help with?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What do Chincillas eat?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think they’re vegetarians, and eat greens and grains and things like that.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay great, where can I buy food for Chinchillas?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A lot of the big stores sell chinchilla food, or maybe you can find some on amazon.com or somewhere like that.   Can I ask you why you want to do this?  Do you want to have a pet Chinchilla?  A Chinchilla is a pretty interesting animal to take care of.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to do this because I have a pet Chinchilla and I want to make sure it has the right food'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Ah, that makes sense.  I didn’t know they liked vegetables so much!  Do you want to know some more about Chinchillas?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, Can you also tell me how much water they need to drink?'}]
