DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How long should you weight train a day?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It depends on many things, including what goal you’re trying to achieve, but there is a lot of research on optimal workout duration and there are very strong arguments to spend at least 30-60 minutes of weight training per session.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you start out with less if you are a beginner?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you know how to help someone when they experience a panic attack?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I’m happy to talk about that. When someone has a panic attack it means that they’re having some of the symptoms of anxiety. In some situations people feel some of these symptoms: feeling tense, experiencing muscle tension, shortness of breath, and they might even feel like they need to “run away” or “flee”. But even if the situation doesn’t seem very scary, if the person experiences those symptoms they might have a panic attack.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. So now can you tell me how to help them?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s a pretty tough question. I have some ideas, but it would be much more effective if you asked the person who has the panic attack. In general I would try to validate their feelings and try to show them that their experience isn’t unusual.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, do you have any more general ideas?'}]
