DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who is making the better cpu these days? AMD or Intel?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What do you mean by better?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Intel use to be faster and more stable. Is that still true?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It depends. I would guess that AMD offers better features and lower cost on the mainstream desktop and server market, but Intel is still likely to be the best choice if you want to get high performance workstation-class CPUs.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Has AMD made any strides in the processor speed competition between them and Intel?'}]
