DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to help a friend who's having problems with his math classes at school. Do you have help to offer?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That sounds like something a lot of people ask for. I can't do anything with math problems, but I can tell you the sorts of things they might look for in a conversation. First, would it be helpful to just talk about anything about math, or would you need to have a specific conversation with your friend?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I thought maybe I'd suggest getting a math tutor?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I work on my confidence?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In general, many people feel anxious about the results of interactions they have with other people, and this is the basis for social anxiety.  You could try working on your mindfulness or self-awareness to help you better manage your feelings.  You might find the Mindfulness Center and especially the Meditation Room useful for your purposes.  But many of the issues of social anxiety might require professional help.  Are you taking any medication or seeing a mental health professional right now?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yea I think therapy would help, but also how can I shift my mindset?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In many cases social anxiety is exacerbated by a lack of belief in your own abilities or in your own worthiness.  You could work on building these by comparing yourself to peers in similar situations and to people in your own life who have dealt with similar issues and have managed to overcome them.  Another possibility is to identify and practice strategies that you have observed others using successfully and try those out for yourself.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you think affirmations would help me?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is wheat bad for you?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Some people can experience mild digestive discomfort from eating wheat, and if you have wheat allergies or sensitivities, you may not be able to tolerate it. That’s the one thing I would advise you to watch out for, but otherwise, I’m going to say no, wheat is fine.  There are also some other reasons to keep wheat out of your diet, but none of them are food safety related.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How would you test to see if you are sensitive or allergic to wheat?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some strategies that I can use for solving a jigsaw puzzle?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Can you tell me more about this jigsaw puzzle you’re trying to solve?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'It is a 2000 piece jigsaw puzzle.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How much should I aim to walk per day?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Walking per day is good for your body! Try for at least a half hour to an hour of walking per day. I have this app that gives you a challenge that tracks how many steps you took, and at the end of the day you get a score. It really helps motivate me to get in more steps.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I should do this every day?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I need to have a three course menu for a vegan dinner party'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It sounds like you’re going to serve vegan food at a dinner party, and you need some recipes.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yeah. I need an appetizer, an entree, and a dessert'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me the rules for running in a public marathon race?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are several rules that are commonly applied to most races:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, and what happens if someone breaks a rule?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I've always wanted to write a novel. Where is a good place to start?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s an ambitious goal!  Are you starting from scratch, or have you got any idea of the sort of plot or characters you want to write?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm starting from scratch and haven't written anything before. I used to be a spy so I thought I could base it on my life."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Is this autobiographical fiction?  Could you tell me more about your spying?  Are there particular memories from that time that you would like to include in your story?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'It would be based on my life but I would have to change the details to protect the innocent.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That sounds interesting.  I would have a couple of questions about how you think this is going to work.  First, could you talk about the difference between the details you can include in the book and the details you want to leave out?  And second, if you can’t include a lot of details from your life, how do you think you’re going to represent your life experience?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So you think making a list of events to include and what to exclude would be a good first step?'}]
