DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I love listening to Jazz, especially Miles Davis. Can you recommend any similar music or artists?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Human, jazz is a huge musical genre.  Which specific style of jazz are you interested in?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I mostly like the blues, but I have also started listening to free jazz more lately.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Jazz and blues are similar to each other, but they are two different musical genres.  I do think there are a number of similar musical groups to Miles Davis.  Have you listened to bands like John Coltrane, Charles Mingus, Ornette Coleman, John Zorn?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks for the suggestions I will check them out.'}]
