uide can also save you from having to make complicated itineraries, or worrying about your own safety.  For example, if you’re going to see Rome and Florence, the tour will also go to nearby sites that are also worth seeing.  If you don’t have a tour guide, then it might be difficult to find a good place to stay for your trip, and to make sure that you don’t accidentally end up spending too much money on something that isn’t worth it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is Italy welcoming to US tourists?'}]
