DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'The play Wicked was really successful for a few years. What is the plot overall?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Here’s a full synopsis of the story:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Some of that sounds in line with the original Oz series. Although I sensed it was more about the struggle of good and evil, within the same person?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think the theme of The Wizard of Oz is about the power of goodness to defeat evil, and the power of forgiveness to let go of pain and hurt.  Wicked is set in an alternate Oz with a very different ending.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How are the endings different?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In Wicked, Elphaba fails to kill the Wizard, but still becomes Queen, and is able to use her magic to heal people and undo the horrible things that happened in Oz.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Seems like Elphaba has a better writer in Wicked, than in the original series, to offer a different voice, to a familiar character.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm not sure why but lately I seem to have lost interest in, well, everything. I work, I come home, I sleep, I work again, etc. My former hobbies just seem kind of blah to me now and I don't have anything new that's piquing my interest. This is a new experience for me and I'm worried. What is happening to me?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure, but we’re going to be trying to figure it out together!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay, sounds good. I hope you can help because I don't like feeling this way. I am used to enjoying my life and exploring my interests and I don't like how that seems to no longer be the case."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, so when you think about all of the things you used to enjoy, what comes to mind? Are there certain activities or topics you’d like to do that you don’t have time for anymore?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "It's not so much that I don't have time, it's more that I just don't feel compelled by them anymore. I used to do lot of writing, both on fiction and journaling types of projects, and that seems dull to me now. I used to enjoy photography, but that too seems pointless. Nothing is energizing me."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you think you can explain to me what exactly “energizing” means to you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "You know, like I'm looking forward to getting into it as soon as possible -- something that perks me up, excites me. I don't know what those things are now because they're not what they used to be."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you have any guesses as to why things aren’t as fun as they used to be for you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "No. That's why this is frustrating to me, it just seems to have come from nowhere."}]
