DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me about Down Syndrome?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Down Syndrome is a genetic condition which can be detected through a simple blood test.  It is caused by a deletion in a chromosome on the 21st pair, which will cause decreased mental capacity, a smaller head size, and learning disabilities.  When I am concerned that a baby has Down Syndrome, I recommend that the parents have a blood test done to confirm, because it’s best to know for sure.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Any other symptoms?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Symptoms may be seen early on, including a gap between the pinky and ring fingers, slanted eyes, and a small head.  This may or may not be noted by a doctor at a prenatal checkup.  Down Syndrome can also be identified during the first year of a child’s life, as the child shows physical and mental disabilities that are more apparent as they age.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What do you mean a gap between the pinky and ring fingers?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'People with Down Syndrome are said to have "mitten deformities", meaning that the ring finger is often larger than the pinky, and the thumb and index finger are often joined.  Many people with Down Syndrome may have a heart murmur, and some will have scoliosis, a spinal curve, or intestinal obstruction, and will have problems with a number of other functions.  In more severe cases, Down Syndrome can cause intellectual disabilities, vision problems, hearing impairments, developmental delays, and various physical disabilities.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Hmm, okay. Does it affect the lifespan?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some bands that are similar in style to Pavement?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'So many great bands have played on Pavement’s second record, Slanted and Enchanted.  Here are some bands that are at least somewhat similar: The Shins, Ride, The Cure, Dinosaur Jr., Mazzy Star, Slowdive, Bikini Kill, Sonic Youth, Belle and Sebastian, My Bloody Valentine, Sunny Day Real Estate, Modest Mouse, Neutral Milk Hotel, and Yo La Tengo.  Are you sure you meant to ask for bands that are similar in sound, though?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, that is what I meant. You gave me a good variety of bands.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'To clarify, I can give you a list of bands that play “real” music, or “alternative” music.  There are many different styles of alternative music and these are the ones that are popular among people that listen to alternative music.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "No, I'm fine with the list you gave me. Can you tell me more The Shins?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you asking for a summary of The Shins, or information about them?  Because if you want more information on The Shins, I think the best thing to do would be to listen to the albums they made.  If you are specifically looking for a summary of what’s on their albums, I could give you one: On Oh Inverted World is their first album. It’s described as “sonic masterpiece.” The more accessible sound of Chutes Too Narrow, their second album, helped The Shins expand their audience.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Thanks I'll listen to some of their albums and also check out the other bands that you recommended."}]
