haracter for the story'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, I see!  How does the fictional character relate to the story?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'They would be the bad person in the story'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What kind of bad?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The kind of bad that makes you think one thing and then they do another.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you mean they are manipulative?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want to make up a story where there are different kinds of bad people?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'sort of. yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Would you like help with a plot?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Would you like help to find an idea that can become a complete story?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would be happy to help you!  It sounds like you want to start by describing the characters and then I could try to help you find a plot that would work well for the characters.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think one of the characters in a Psychiatrist that has a dark backstory.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What does this mean?  “a dark backstory”?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "It means that something bad happened in the character's past."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I see.  Do you want to use the psychiatrist as the bad person?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'no.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Who do you want to be the bad person?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "The Psychiatrist's husband."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why?  What is he like?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Everyone thinks he is normal but he is responsible for horrible things.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you mean he is a rapist?  Or a murderer?  Or something else?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think he should be holding people captive in their cabin.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are these other people people you are creating?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes. They will be patients of the psychiatrist.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want to include the psychiatrist?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'In the story, yes.'}]
