DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'what are some other games i might like if i like tennis?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'well there are sports games and things, but also a wide variety of non-sports games and things that might be of interest, and as a first step, a list of some of the most well-known games might be helpful.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'okay i want to know sports'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'you can play tennis, racquetball, squash, and various hockey and baseball games, to name a few.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'what is racquetball?'}]
