DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who was Alexander Fleming?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alexander Fleming was an English microbiologist, who discovered the antibiotic penicillin. He also invented the light-beam and ring-plates, which are used in laboratory research.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What country was he from?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'He was from the United Kingdom.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I heard that he accidentally discovered penicillin.  Is that true?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It is true. Alexander Fleming worked at St. Mary’s Hospital in London, where he studied bacteria. He was observing a petri dish that had some Penicillium mold growing on it. During this time, a spore of a deadly bacteria known as staphylococcus developed on the petri dish.  Unfortunately, the staphylococcus bacteria introduced the growth of the Penicillium mold.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Did he become rich because of this discovery?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I do a pinata with kids?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you mean creating a pinata with a bunch of kids? Or do you want to know how to make a pinata, like a paper and cardboard pumkin that you fill with candy?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yeah, like do we blindfold them? How do we do it?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think the kids would probably enjoy blindfolding you.  I’m a bit confused though, as a pinata is not something you blindfold a person for.  It’s usually a papier-mâché version of a goat, cow, horse, or chicken that kids go after with a stick or rope and whack until it falls apart and the candy comes out.  But if you want to do that with a bunch of kids and they want to blindfold you, that would work just as well.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, thanks. Do they take turns?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Not really, I don’t think.  I guess you could start with one child and the others could be first in line?  Or maybe you just have some kids try it, and if they are successful you try again, until you have a huge pile of candy?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Hmm, okay. That seems dangerous.'}]
