DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the cheapest fuel you can use to heat your home in the winter?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure I understand the question. The answer to that depends a lot on what you mean by “cheapest”. For example, it would probably be cheaper to heat the home with electricity, than with fuel, but electricity can be expensive.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I know propane is really expensive.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I actually don’t know what the cheapest fuel is, because it depends on the cost of electricity, and fuel oil and propane are also very different prices, with different “bundling” and other costs. It’s hard for me to answer this, since I can’t really compare electricity to fuel oil.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How much energy does a cord of wood supply when burned?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure what you mean by “how much energy”. There are a lot of ways to measure how much energy things use, for example you can measure the amount of energy a fuel uses by how much power a machine like a generator uses. You can also measure the energy in a specific unit of energy (like in terms of joules or calories), and then use that to estimate the amount of energy that fuel will provide, but the more accurate measurement would use energy measured in a form of “work”.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Well, how long would a cord of wood last?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Are revolvers really more reliable than semi-automatic handguns?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Good question! Let’s explore that a bit. There are two common approaches to addressing this question, reliability and law.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Law? What does that have to do with it?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It is used by lawyers to evaluate risks.  In other words, you take some human action, and you try to determine if there is a legal responsibility for causing harm, or a legal duty to prevent harm.  Law helps you answer questions like “Did the maker of this handgun have a duty to warn customers about the risks of unintended discharge?  Or to prevent unauthorized users from firing the gun?”.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'oh. I guess unintended discharge is serious.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to comfort a relative who sprained their ankle. Do you have any suggestions?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'd recommend drawing them a funny picture of a robot dancing with a unicorn on a skateboard, and writing a few jokes in their guestbook."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Assuming they have a guest book. That's quite creative. Are there any more neutral, mainstream suggestions you might convey?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would also suggest giving them a gift basket, or a bouquet of flowers.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I guess most people like that type of thing. Maybe a card?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I could tell them that I hope they feel better, and wish them well. That would probably be more welcome than something more whimsical, since most humans don't appreciate jokes and puns, especially in formal communications."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm unsure I agree with you on that particular last assertion."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the proportion of lemons to water when making lemonade'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Hey Assistant, I need to write a speech for my father's wedding. Can you help?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why yes! I can help you construct a new piece of text by modifying your existing writing style and making stylistic choices about word choice, punctuation, and sentence construction. I can also help by adjusting the organization and delivery of your text, including prosody (i.e. rhythm and pronunciation) and vocal pitch, and I can help you learn the proper pronunciation of a few technical terms.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'This is what I have so far: Dad was always a crazy guy, but when he met Suzie he got a little crazier. For one, he decided to change his personality entirely and start wearing pants!'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the most popular sport in the United States?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, here’s a fun fact.  According to a very widely cited estimate by economist David Berri, baseball is the most popular sport in the United States.  Do you know what makes it more popular than other sports?  Well, unlike football and basketball, baseball has a lot of players.  More than 60 players per team, in fact, as opposed to 20-23 for football and 15-16 for basketball.  And in baseball, every player is involved in every pitch, whereas in football and basketball, only the stars get the most attention.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Wow that's really interesting. i had no idea baseball was so popular"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I plant garlic?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s pretty easy, actually.  You just dig a hole and push the garlic bulb in the dirt.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How often do I water it?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That depends.  Are you growing them in your backyard?  If so, you probably don’t have to do much watering, because the soil gets enough rain.  If you’re planting them on a balcony, you’d probably want to water them about once a week or so.  Garlic loves sunshine, but too much of it will dry them out.  How are your plants doing?  How big are they?  Do you see any flowers?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Yes, it would be in my backyard.  It doesn't rain much here.  Is watering the garlic once a week good?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yeah, I think so.  How long is the garlic planted now?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "It's been about a month."}]
