istant', 'content': 'It’s difficult to speak philosophically about politics because so much is subjective and it’s not always clear where the facts end and where the philosophy begins.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Exactly. This is why it's hard to remain civil about politics at times."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think when discussing politics, it can be helpful to have a sense of where you are coming from, and why you believe the way you do.  I would be happy to listen to you describe your own perspective on the political situation and why you think the way you do.  I will not try to convince you of anything.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Great points. That's all the help I need! Thanks."}]
