DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Hi, I have a small raptor in my back yard that I'm trying to nurse back to health. How do I care for it? For starters, how, and what, do I feed it?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Did it fall from the sky and knock itself out, or did you intentionally find it? If the former, you can read this primer on the state of California’s laws regarding wildlife rescue. Otherwise, if you are familiar with the species, you could find a wild feeding chart on the internet. If not, you should consult a reliable wild animal rehabilitation specialist.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "It injured itself and landed in my yard. I don't live in California, so that law isn't relevant to me, but I'll check the internet and contact specialists tomorrow. For now though, I'd like your suggestions about care and feeding. This is a small species, I believe it's an American Kestrel."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Right, here are a few resources you might be interested in looking at:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay, I'll do that, but between now and then, how do I care for it. You say I can feed it beef tripe, anything else? How about shelter, water? Keeping it calm?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'When should I plant my grass seed?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Can you be more specific about your question?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I have grass seed for my lawn but I need to know the best time of year to plant it'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I can help. Is this a new lawn or just improving your existing one?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Improving my existing one'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'All right. Generally you want to plant your grass seed as soon as the soil can be worked. This is very important, because it helps the seed to get its full growth potential. Ideally, the soil needs to be dry and warm enough that your hand can be in the soil for no more than 15 seconds.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay but what time of year would be best?'}]
