DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Tell me the story of how rudolph saved christmas'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'OK, we can start with the setting: A family of reindeer is travelling to their cabin in the north woods in early December.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Was there any family conflict during the trip?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'No, they made it to the north woods pretty much as a team. There are some excellent food sources near the cabin that they were looking forward to.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "What's their favorite kind of food?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Each of them has a different favorite kind of food. Rudolph likes fresh, green veggies.  Comet likes berries. Dancer loves the sun.  Blitzen loves the night.  They were all really excited to eat the food in the north woods.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Does Blitzen eat the night?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Blitzen has a special night vision and likes to enjoy the night life, as he calls it. He's always up late."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Got it. So what happens at the cabin?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "So after they all get there and are hungry, they go about their normal routine of looking for food. Blitzen was out late and wasn't quite awake yet, but the rest of them were looking for a place to eat."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "What's the dangerous thing that happened?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "What steps do I need to take to close out an account with my bank. I don't want to call and ask the customer service line on their help line, it is never dependable. Can you help me out instead?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Is there something in particular about your account that you’d like to close out?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Well, I am changing banks because the one I have now does not have a mobile banking app and the new one does. They also seem to have better rates at the new bank. So I just need to close out my checking account so I can open up the one at the new bank.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think you’re right that the best course of action would be to close out the account. Can you tell me what your checking account number is?  I’ll call your current bank and ask them to cancel your account and transfer you to the new bank.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Oh, that's alright. I will probably be going down there in person to do it sometime this week. I was just wanting to know what I needed to get the account closed. Do I need any documents or anything like that?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Nope, just the checking account number.  If you’d like, I can even find the process online for you, and I can tell you which documents you will need to bring with you.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Wait that doesn't make sense. I just need my account number, but I also need other documents? That is what I want to know. What do I need to get this account closed?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, I can tell you what the process is if you like.  Are you in the US?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, I am.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm thinking about buying a new baseball cap, but I get overwhelmed with so many options. What are the main shape types of baseball caps?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The most common types of baseball caps have “flat” (also called “relaxed” or “crew”) brims and the more specific types are “curved” (also called “tapered”, “rimmed”, or “skull”) and “flipped” brims. Flat brims are more common than any other kind. Curved and flipped brims are used less often but are more fashionable and more flattering. Flat brims also have a more pronounced association with baseball.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's useful, thank you. I prefer more androgynous styles of baseball caps as well, perhaps monochromatic."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Hi, my toilet bowl has developed an ugly stain in the bottom half, and it's not coming off when I scrub it with the toilet brush. Any tips for getting rid of it?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Have you tried using the hottest setting on the water faucet in addition to scrubbing with the toilet brush? Maybe it would be helpful to run your water for a little longer before using the toilet.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The toilet brush and water are not removing this stain. I need other suggestions for cleaning methods.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm unsure of where to invest my money. I know very little about stocks but might be interested in learning more about them. Can you direct me on where to begin?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure.  I’d like to help, but first I’d like to make sure you understand that I don’t have any expertise in finance.  So if you want to know how to buy stock or trade or invest, you’ll need to find someone who does have expertise in that field.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me a little about the basics of what the stock market is?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure.  The stock market is where the buying and selling of stock is done.  This allows people to make investments, such as buying a share of a company, and receive dividends.  People buy stocks in an attempt to invest in a company.  Some stocks are issued for free, and some are issued through a “bidding” process, where companies sell shares.  When you buy shares you own a portion of the company, and you can expect to get money if the company does well, but that money will be determined by the stock price.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is an annuity?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I have to study for history class. Could you help me give an overview of the French Revolution?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure!  It was a time when the French government was very different from what we’re used to today.  There were three different kinds of government and all of them included a king: the Ancien Régime, the Directory, and the Consulate.  By 1793, France was full of revolutionary ideals.  This is when people started to protest and demand that the French government be made different and more fair for everyone.  This is when the revolution began.  At first, people demanded many things, like more political power for women, that elections were held more frequently, and that the church be held accountable for the violence and abuses done by the clergy.  Eventually, the revolution gained the support of the common people, and overthrew the government.  People quickly formed a new government called the Convention.  It had more power than ever before.  The people felt that it was now possible for people to hold an assembly to govern the nation.  So the convention is what we call the constitution today.  It also saw the beginning of a conflict between what was called Jacobins, and the Girondists.  The Jacobins wanted to become a centralized, authoritarian government, while the Girondists wanted to keep the power decentralized.  The Jacobins were victorious, and eventually they were crushed by Napoleon Bonaparte.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Thanks! That's a lot to take it, however. Do you think you could summarize and simplify it?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, I can try to provide a summary.  During this time period in France, there were many different leaders and groups of people with different political philosophies.  This eventually resulted in the revolution that led to the formation of a government more suited to the people.  And later, this government got involved in a conflict with Napoleon Bonaparte.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay great. Could you explain a little more about what happened with this conflict with Napoleon Bonaparte?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure.  At first, Napoleon was a part of the French government, but he eventually broke off on his own.  He fought in many different wars, and eventually his army was one of the most powerful in the world.  The French government saw the strength of Napoleon’s army and eventually allied with him to fight against other countries.  In the end, the French government changed the constitution to favor Napoleon Bonaparte, and to limit the power of the people.  Napoleon Bonaparte ended up being a dictator.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay that's great. And could you just explain what the initial triggers or causes were for the French Revolution?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is a sweet way to tell someone I miss them?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are the best kind of paintbrushes to use when painting the outside of a house?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hm, there’s no way for me to know, I don’t have any experience painting houses. But my best guess is that it would depend a lot on the surface you’re painting. I’d imagine that the type of paintbrush you’d use would depend on the roughness of the surface, and also how much texture you’re aiming for. Do you know much about the surface of the house you’re painting?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I know that it is flat wood.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'If the wood is flat, I would guess that you’re better off using a paintbrush that doesn’t have any texture or very fine bristles.  Also if it’s flat wood, you might find that a roller is a better tool to use.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'A roller sounds good, do I need any special tools to use a roller?'}]
