DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'what is the reason for the Antarctic Treaty?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The Antarctic Treaty regulates international relations with respect to Antarctica, and the activities of signatory countries. The main focus is environmental protection, as the continent has fragile ecosystems. The countries of the region that signed the treaty have agreed not to put bases on the continent, to preserve its wildlife, and generally to respect the environment.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'but why? Antarctica is a desolate continent. Why not protect the other continents?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, the treaty was originally signed in 1959, and Antarctica was mainly uninhabited at that time. Over the years, more and more human activity has occurred on Antarctica, due to natural resource exploration and tourism.  So the treaty was put in place to protect Antarctic environments from exploitation.  In addition, the treaty allows for the continuation of scientific research in Antarctica.  The main goal is to keep Antarctica pristine.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I understand what we are told but it doesn't make sense. Why can't people go there without government permission?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What does grief feel like?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Grief can be described as a complicated mix of emotions like sadness, loneliness, longing, fear, and a sense of loss.  I’m sorry to hear about your grief.  You may experience many different emotions about your loss, and you may not be able to easily predict what you’ll feel in the future.  Grief may last for weeks, months, or years, and it’s perfectly normal to feel it will last forever.  Grief can be similar to sadness, but it’s different in that it’s also related to feelings of anger or regret.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you elaborate on that?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to try to make Belgian waffles. Can you help me?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure!  Belgian waffles are the waffle of choice in Belgium.  They are dense, and often topped with cream and powdered sugar.  How can I help?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you give me a list of ingredients first?  I think I only have sugar and flour at home.  I need to run to the store.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I can give you a shopping list.  What are the quantities you need to buy?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't know.   Perhaps you can tell me?  I need to make four waffles only."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "You’re going to need four cups of flour, and at least a tablespoon or two of sugar.  If you're serving two people, you'll probably want to buy three cups of flour."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'You did not include water or milk in the recipe.'}]
