DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am trying to become a better photographer. Do you have any tips?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The first tip I’d give you is to take lots of pictures!  You’ll always end up with some duds, so it’s a good idea to try to make sure you get a bunch of good ones too.  You can then edit them down to the best ones.  It’s a lot more useful to spend your time editing, than it is trying to guess what the best picture will be, without shooting it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's a good start! What are some general tips about lighting for photography?"}]
