DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How does ruby on rails work?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Ruby on Rails (RoR) is a web application framework, often referred to as a “web framework”.  It provides various tools for web developers, such as automatic database structure creation, and helpers to allow for easy rendering of HTML and other web content.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How long does it take to learn?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are many guides to learning RoR online.  It’s possible to learn in a week or two, though it can be difficult to get the hang of without a mentor or teacher.  It’s also possible to learn as much as you want on your own, though there will be additional resources you could benefit from.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Would you need to have experience with any other frameworks or coding experience to learn the basic concepts of RoR?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'RoR is a very high-level web framework, which means it will be easier to learn and will require less experience with other frameworks or coding languages.  I think it would be good for you to at least know some HTML and CSS, but if you don’t you’ll be able to pick it up just fine.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Are HTML and CSS basic development skills?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) is the basic formatting language for most web pages.  CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) is a language for describing the formatting of various aspects of a web page.  It’s not difficult to learn, and is a prerequisite to learning RoR.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Are there any other prerequisites to learning RoR?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You should know at least some of the basics of the RoR framework.  If you’ve already learned and can apply the basics of RoR to a project, you may be able to do pretty much anything on the RoR framework.  I’d recommend reading some of the RoR tutorials online, and completing a simple project.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'And can you tell me more about automatic database structure creation?'}]
