ourse.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'of course.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s what I’d prefer.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'ok. sounds good to me. I like iced normally. however, in the morning I typically have hot coffee.'}]
