’s make a plan.  First, we’ll need to set a few goals to help us with that.  Here’s an example of a goal for you to consider:'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m so glad you brought up meditation.  That’s a really effective way to improve your mindfulness and trust in yourself.  It might also help you with your peace of mind.  Do you have a free period of time during the week that you’re free to sit quietly and meditate for about 10-30 minutes?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm down to meditate more! What should be the focus of my practice?"}]
