DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to learn how to use Wordpress to set up a new website. Can you help?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure! Can you tell me a bit more about what you want to do?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to make a blog about art, including different articles and images."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "OK, great, I'll be your assistant on this project.  I can definitely help you with Wordpress, and if you have questions about using Wordpress for a blog, I'll also be able to help you."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Is Wordpress free to use, or will I have to pay?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Wordpress is absolutely free, so you don't have to pay anything to use it.  The creators of Wordpress offer it for free because they want to make it available to everyone.  If you want to pay for a premium version of Wordpress, that's a different story.  They offer a few premium versions, and I think you can find one that's right for your situation.  The premium version includes all of the premium features, but also comes with support from the Wordpress creators and their team.   If you want a more customizable experience, then I recommend this version."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. I think I will start with the free version and take it from there. Do I need to know how to code to use Wordpress?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'My toilet has been running non-stop. I heard there is an easy fix for this?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why don’t you tell me more about the problem? I’m not an expert in toilets.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "The water coming into the toilet won't turn off. I think it might be the valve? Do you have any tips?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Perhaps you’re correct about the problem being with the valve. Did you try unplugging it and then waiting to see if the flow stops?  Also, did you try flushing the toilet?  I understand this can be used to help turn off the valve.  Perhaps there is another problem and that is why the valve doesn’t stop.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I tried flushing it already. What do you mean unplug the valve?'}]
