DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Are my neighbors talking behind my back'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That is a subjective question, which means there isn’t a right or wrong answer.  Do you have a specific reason to think your neighbors are talking about you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Because they talk about each other. I saw one and they wouldn't acknowledge me. they are usually friendly"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, that is a sign that they are upset with you.  Do you know why?  Have you done anything that would upset your neighbors?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'not that i know of'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you planning to do anything that would upset them in the near future?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'nope not at all'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Then why did your neighbors behave this way?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am not sure why'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why do you think that the neighbors are upset with you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'i am not sure why. there is a chance theyre upset about something else'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What might be the possible cause of their upset?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'they are being sued'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That is likely a cause.  Have you done anything that would be a cause of their upset?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'no i wouldnt upset them'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'So what are your future plans for the neighbors?  Do you plan to do anything that might upset them?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'i dont know if i should say hi to them in the future or ignore them'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'When the neighbors ignored you, were you hurt?  Did you want to talk to them?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'i thought it was rude of them'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why were you hurt?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'because they usually acknowledge me'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why is it important that they acknowledge you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'because i think it is the socially acceptable thing for them to do'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you think they should acknowledge you because you think it is the socially acceptable thing to do?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you think they should acknowledge you for another reason?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'nope'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why do you think the socially acceptable reason is important?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'if i dont acknowledge them then they will know what it feels like'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Have you had any problems with your neighbors in the past?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'nope not at all'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you feeling angry about what happened?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'no but i do not like it'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Is it the fact that they ignored you that bothers you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why do you think the fact that they ignored you bothers you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'because i was friends with them'}]
