DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'My best friends are in a fight and it is putting stress on our friend group. How can I help them see through their disagreement?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Gosh, this sounds really complicated. What kind of conflict are they fighting about? Is it a problem they can talk out? Are you there to help mediate?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "One friend doesn't like the other friend's boyfriend, so they aren't speaking. I want to help mediate."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Ahh, now it's starting to make more sense. I would think that you can be a great mediator for this. Is there anything else you would like me to help with?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I get them together and have them talk it out?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "OK, let's say that you get them to the point where they're trying to talk, and you can be a witness. The most important thing is that they have the tools and skills to handle the disagreement."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What is a good neutral location for them to have their talk?'}]
