DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I just bought an electric griddle for making waffles.  Do you have a simple recipe?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'We can share a recipe for an elaborate, fancy waffle with chocolate sauce, strawberry sauce, and cream cheese.  Or we can make a simple waffle with just melted butter and sugar.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'A simple one is okay with me.  I am not a good cook.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Here is a simple, quick recipe that you can do.  It makes a large waffle.  First, you will melt some butter in the oven, then pour the butter onto the waffle maker.  Next you will pour in about 1 cup of flour, and mix it in with your hands.  This flour is called “self-rising” flour, because it already contains leavening agents.  Next, you will add some milk to the flour and mix it with your hands.  The milk helps to hold the mixture together and give you a smooth waffle.  Finally, you will pour the mixture onto the waffle maker.  Here is the recipe:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think your recipe will work.  It looks easy enough for me.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It does sound easy!  A waffle is a soft, tender food, but it also has a crusty outside, which makes it satisfying and substantial.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What syrups would you suggest I put on my waffles?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You could add a drizzle of syrup, butter, or jam, or you could add some berries or cream cheese.  Your waffles don’t have to be fancy, but you can really have fun with this.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Whipped cream and various berries sound good to me.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It sounds like you will be having a fun meal!  You could also add a fruit topping.  Do you know about fruit topping?  It’s a simple mixture of sugar and cornstarch, with fruit puree mixed in.  You can use fresh fruit or a store bought fruit puree.  You can also add some sort of flavoring, like cinnamon or nutmeg.  And you can also put some whipped cream on your waffles.  Did I forget to mention that?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'It sounds yummy.  I will make the fruit topping that you suggested.  Thank you much.'}]
