ontent': 'That video is not available anymore.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sorry, I meant to direct you to another version of the video:  http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tVniIq2d0yw'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Back to Monarch Programming, why is that what it\'s called? Why "Monarch" programming?'}]
