DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What cosmetics do people use to reduce wrinkles?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Some of the most common products include anti-wrinkle serums, creams, creams, and serums.  Depending on the type of wrinkle you are trying to reduce, you may want to choose between anti-aging products that are designed for wrinkles on the face, or serums or creams that work to reduce or eliminate wrinkles on other parts of the body.  Additionally, you can use creams and serums that target the appearance of fine lines, such as crow’s feet.  These are frequently advertised as “anti-aging creams” but can be effective for other wrinkles too.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Your answer was too long and meandering. Some parts were repeated for no reason. However it's also mostly correct so I'll accept this answer. Do you have anything else to add?"}]
