s) or allergies can cause excessive shedding.\n- **Stress:** A stressful environment or a change in routine can cause your cat to shed more or less.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **How can you help your cat shed less?**\n\n#### **A. Nutrition:**\n- **Feed a high-quality, balanced diet.** Avoid processed foods and opt for cat food with the', "</think>\n\nYes, that's correct. One of the key advantages of forming an LLC (Limited Liability Company) is **limited liability**. This means that the owners (called members) of the LLC are protected from personal liability for the debts and obligations of the business. In other business structures, like corporations or sole proprietorships, owners can be personally liable for the business's debts and lawsuits. \n\nFor example, if a business owner runs a restaurant and the restaurant is sued, the owner's personal assets (like their home or car) are generally protected from being used to pay the business's debts. This protection is one of the main reasons many people choose to form an LLC.\n\nSo, **yes**, an LLC provides **less liability** to its owners compared to other business structures.", '</think>\n\nGreat question! Here are a few ways to say "help" in Hungarian:\n\n- **Segítsen** – This is the most common and polite way to say "help" in Hungarian. It\'s like "help" in English.\n- **Segíts**\n- **Segíts a miénket** – This is a more formal or more direct way to say "help us" (help us with something).\n- **Hívd meg** – This is a bit more formal and means "call someone" or "ask them to help".\n- **Segíts nekem** – This is a more direct way to say "help me".\n- **Hívd meg a miénket** – This is a bit more formal and means "help us with something".\n\nIf you\'re just starting out, **segítsen** is the safest and most common way to say "help" in Hungarian. Let me know if you\'d like examples', '</think>\n\nHere are some good sources of vitamin C:\n\n1. **Citrus fruits**: Lemons, limes, oranges, and grapefruits are all rich in vitamin C.  \n2. *