e': 'assistant', 'content': "Great!  You could pick up any type of bread, and also get some naan bread, which is a type of doughy flat bread.  It's common to serve naan bread with Indian food."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So I made the curry for dinner and it was good, but I got green curry and think red curry would have been better. Thanks for the recommendations! Can you tell me what the difference between red and green curry is?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "There are many different types of curry, and they tend to vary by region.  In Thailand, they use fresh turmeric, and in the Indian subcontinent it's a powder.  If you like the flavor of curry, you should probably try something like the Pad Thai, which is a good Thai dish, but also combines the ingredients of a curry dish with the familiar Thai flavours."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Interesting! I will definitely try those. I did like the flavor but I think next time I'll use it with fish instead of chicken. I also want it to be  more spicy. What is the spiciest curry?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That's a great question.  Do you mean in terms of spiciness level, or in terms of how much you want it to be spicy?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, the spiciness level. I want it super hot.'}]
