DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who is Michael Jordan?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'He is the most famous basketball player in history, and widely considered to be the greatest player of all time. He is an American, and has been a professional player since he was in high school, which is an unusual choice for a very talented high school student. He is named after his father who, ironically, played college basketball at a small university in North Carolina, and had a short stint in the NBA, before being drafted for military service in Korea. But he suffered a significant shoulder injury that ended his basketball career, and led to a long and painful recovery process. He ended up working in the tire business, until the family suffered economic hardship, and he took a job as a sportscaster.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is there anyone else more famous than Michael Jordan in basketball?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'No, he is considered the best player of all time, and so no one is considered as successful as he has been.  There are some other very good players in the NBA.  This is because the NBA has a regular season where teams can play different players in different roles.  The season also has playoffs, and the best teams in the league are invited to the championship finals, which are held over several games.  To be the best player, you need to be able to play against different kinds of players, as well as having an understanding of what your team needs, and a good understanding of the game.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who is better, Michael Jordan or Magic Johnson?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I get my child to keep on his hat?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m sorry, I’m not familiar with this situation. Can you tell me more?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My son is always tugging his hat off. He is three.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Hmm, this is a common problem. I recommend teaching your son a specific behavior for wearing the hat. For example, “You have to put the hat on the couch every day when you come in from playing, and you have to sit on the couch for 5 minutes before you take it off.  If you forget, you will lose it for one day.”  This means that at first you have to hold on to the hat, which may be unpleasant for you, but your son will get used to it.  After that, the rule doesn’t have to be quite so strict, you can just remind him and he will be more likely to comply.  You may also want to try talking to your son about why it is important for him to keep his hat on, and how it will help him to protect his head from the sun.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, that makes sense.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Does fish oil have any benefits?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The benefits of fish oil, as well as omega-3 fatty acids in general, include fighting inflammation and improving overall heart health.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Should you take it everyday?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Studies of omega-3 fatty acids in general have found that it’s a good idea to take it daily.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do much should you take per day?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'For your health, the recommended amount is 1 to 2 grams daily.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you for the information.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm looking to get a house and lot through a broker, and I'm told financing will be through a bank loan. I was told to open a checking account. How does a bank loan work when buying a property?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, let\'s break this down!   So the bank will issue a loan to you, and it will usually be secured by a mortgage on the property.   That means that, if you don\'t pay the bank back, the bank can foreclose on the property and sell it.  That\'s basically what a "mortgage" is.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks. But, why a checking account? Why not a normal savings account?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "That sounds reasonable!  To make a payment to the bank for the loan, you can either withdraw cash from your checking account or you can write a check and deposit the check into your checking account.  That check goes to the bank, and they'll add the payment to the loan account.  A savings account doesn't have those options -- it can't be written into."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How does the developer or property seller get paid?'}]
