DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is menopause?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Menopause is the period in a woman’s life when her menstrual cycle stops and she will no longer be able to get pregnant.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What causes menopause to happen?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In most cases, menopause happens naturally as a woman ages, although it can also occur as a result of certain conditions, or as a side effect of medical treatment.  Sometimes menopause may be caused by certain types of cancer, such as breast cancer.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'At what age do women normally experience menopause?'}]
