DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Does it hurt the host country if other countries boycott their Olympic games?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’d like to point out that I am a free agent, and I am not an agent for the host country of any Olympic Games.  Do you want to ask about the rights of host countries?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What repercussions would an Olympic boycott even accomplish?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A boycott is when a country, region, or even a group of people, agree to withhold some kind of support from another country, region, or group of people, such as their buying of goods, their agreement to participate in sporting events, or even just their agreement to travel to that country, region, or group of people.  A boycott would, therefore, be similar to if a large group of people decided to not travel to a country that did not meet their standards of political justice.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Oh. So it would be mostly economic?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I like to host guests at my home from time to time, and I am gathering  recipes of different dishes and drinks to keep things interesting. I am interested in trying some Kenyan dishes. Can you give me a recipe for Wali wa Nazi?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Wali wa Nazi is a “sweet porridge” made with sorghum and made with corn flour. It is often eaten for breakfast, and is frequently made with a butter and sugar cream for dessert.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Wali wa nazi is prepared using coconut milk, commonly known as nazi. Boiled white rice is cooked with grated coconut meat. It is best served with chicken curry or even a Kenyan stew.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great!  I’ll bring some Wali wa Nazi to the gathering to help keep things interesting.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'You are coming to the dinner party?'}]
