DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm travelling abroad and need ask for the train station in different languages. Can you help?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would be happy to help.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks! How would I say "Where is the train" in Portuguese?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I\'m afraid I\'m not fluent in Portuguese, but I can give you the default Google translation and explain how to search for train station locations.  First, open the translator at translator.google.com and click on "english to ______" on the upper right.  Select Portuguese from the list, and put in the following phrase: "Train station" or "Where is the train station"'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Thank you for your honesty.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There is more information available on the Google Translate website about the translation service and how it works.   Is there anything else you need to know about Portuguese?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Could you tell me how to say "Where is the train?" in Spanish?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How many cigarettes can I smoke a day without ruining my health?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'We’re not medical professionals and I’m certainly not going to give medical advice on this forum. It’s true that moderate smoking is safer than heavy smoking, but I can’t know if you’re a moderate smoker or a heavy smoker without asking some questions. For example, what are your current smoking habits? How much did you smoke last year, on average? Are you currently trying to quit smoking?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I smoke a pack a day. I'm not trying to quit but considering reducing."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am trying to learn more about the history of artificial intelligence. Can you teach me about the creator of the first AI system?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Can you describe what you mean by “artificial intelligence”? What’s its relation to “machine learning”? Is that the sort of thing you’re interested in?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Sure, here's a definition that fits my purpose:"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh I see, cool. I have some ideas about where to start then. Since it seems like you’re interested in how computers have started to mimic human intelligence, I would suggest you start by looking at the history of the “symbolic systems” approach to AI. In this approach, computers are programmed to represent things with symbols and use mathematical rules to manipulate them.  For example, if the computer represents the sun as the symbol, and the planet Earth as the symbol, and a specific date in human history as the symbol, then the computer could look for the conjunction between "the sun" and "Earth" at "July 4, 1776". This symbolic approach has been used to build knowledge-based systems, and is now used to implement machine learning algorithms.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you please provide me information on the creator of the first scientifically recognized artificial intelligence system.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sorry, I don’t know that person’s name.  If you tell me a bit about the circumstances of their accomplishment, and more specific information about what they did, maybe I can figure it out.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Yikes. A quick search told me it was Alan Turing....I'll go learn about this myself. Bye."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I make homemade strawberry jam?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s pretty straightforward, you just need a lot of strawberries, sugar, and lemon juice, but it can be fun to put together!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Great. Can you give me the instructions?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure! Let’s get started. First you need to select your strawberries.  Choose ones that are red on the outside, but still have their stems attached.  You can also buy strawberries in a package and you should choose those that have as little extra packaging as possible, so you can avoid any preservatives or wax.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. What next?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Next you will want to wash and prepare your strawberries.  Wash them under running water, and then dry them with a paper towel.  Once you’ve washed the berries, use the tip of a knife to remove their stems.  You can do this by gently cutting below the leaves, and using the knife to pull the berry up.  You should not pull the leaves off at the stem, but just try to cut around them and take a little bit of the berry underneath the leaves.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Go on'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I go to sleep when I am having an active mind?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What is happening in your active mind that is keeping you awake?  You should tell me what is going on and what your thoughts are so that I can help you.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'It is usually just repeating thoughts.'}]
