ites?**\nGenealogy sites are online platforms that help people research their family trees, genealogy, and history. These sites collect data from:\n- **Family trees** (like trees of the Ancestry.com or FamilySearch)\n- **Family histories**\n- **Birth, marriage, death records**\n- **Cemetery records**\n- **Local newspapers**\n- **Marriage and death certificates**\n\nThese sites often use **database records**, which are **archived** and **not real-time**. The data is usually **not from the original sources** but from **historical records** and **database entries**.\n\n---\n\n### 2."]
