DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is tennis easy to learn?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Tennis is a game that involves hitting a ball over a net using one’s racket. There are many different techniques that can be used to effectively hit the ball.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you learn as an adult or should you learn as a kid?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can learn as an adult, but it will likely be more difficult. Some people think that it is best to learn when young, and that older people would do better with a form of golf.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you.'}]
