DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I get started with Falconry?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can practice with anything that flies, but you can find some cool, free resources online:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "These links aren't working. Do I need some kind of permit? I also think I have to train under someone that is experienced."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'If you want to train a hawk you may need a “sporting permit”, but you also want to make sure you’re taking care of your hawk, because falconry is illegal in many US states.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I looked it up and it is legal in my state. Also, I see that I need a permit and sponsor to start out in falconry. I would start out as an apprentice.'}]
