Also, the angle of the putter. Do I need to aim for a certain angle when putting? I think the angle of the putter affects how", '</think>\n\nSure! Here are a few **keto breakfast recipes** that include **3 eggs**, **meat (like bacon or sausage)**, and **veggies**. These are all low-carb, high-protein, and rich in healthy fats, perfect for a keto breakfast!\n\n---\n\n### **1. Keto Pancakes (with 3 Eggs)**  \n**Ingredients**:  \n- 3 eggs  \n- 1 slice bacon or 1 ounce sausage  \n- 1 small handful of spinach or kale  \n- 1 tsp butter (or butter substitute)  \n- 1 tsp vanilla extract (optional)  \n- 1 tsp cinnamon (optional)  \n\n**Instructions**:  \n1. Mix the eggs, bacon, veggies, butter, and vanilla in a bowl.  \n2. Heat a non-stick pan with a bit of oil.  \n3. Pour the mix into the pan and cook until the edges set, then flip.  \n4. Repeat with the second pancake']
