DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me the process for signing up for a gym membership?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure.  First you’ll need to select a gym.  Do you prefer a traditional gym with lots of machines and equipment, or would you prefer a gym with yoga, meditation, and a nice view?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes I am interested in a traditional gym.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Ok, great.  Then you will need to contact the gym, and let them know you are interested in signing up.  You will need to fill out an online application and mail in a copy of your driver’s license.  You will also need to schedule an in-person meeting with a member of the staff, and meet with a trainer to get some information about your health history.  Does that make sense?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes thanks. What are the typical fee structures for a gym membership?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you explain how the electoral college works in regard to electing the president of the United States?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure. The electoral college was instituted at the Constitutional Convention in 1787, and has been in use ever since. Each state elects electors, who then cast their votes for president. The candidate with the most votes, which is a majority of electors, wins.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How are the electors chosen?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I splint a fractured hand?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A good, functional, solution is going to depend on the location and severity of the injury. A human has other muscles and other injuries they might need to attend to, or take care of. How much time can you afford to be focusing on the fractured hand and splinting it?  The splinting itself isn’t going to be very difficult, but it does take some time, and if you have to spend a lot of time splinting the hand, you could be neglecting other important functions.  You could also need to get the fractured hand treated with medicines or by a doctor.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How effective are homemade splints?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me what the code of hammurabi was?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure! Hammurabi was an early ruler in ancient Babylon and this code of his was a legal code.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some details of the legal code?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The code dealt with civil and criminal law, and it regulated contracts, property rights, and restitution for injured parties.  The code also included several sections about the ways Babylon should be governed, and about the proper conduct for public officials.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who enforced the laws?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me why dogs howl at the moon?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure exactly why they howl at the moon. But some animals, like cats, bark at the moon for reasons we humans can’t really understand.   Dogs might howl at the moon because they love howling, but they also might howl at the moon because they feel scared.  Or maybe they have some sort of religious reasons.  Maybe dogs and cats and other animals worship the moon?  Maybe they howl at the moon because they think the moon is a nice, friendly, safe place, and want to show their feelings for the moon?  If a dog howls at the moon, how do you feel about that?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think they howl at the moon because that they are descendants of wolves.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you trying to suggest that dogs are descended from wolves?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes'}]
