DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I suffer from varicose veins and need to improve my circulation. What are some ways I could improve my blood circulation throughout my body?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Have you tried getting more physical activity?  Have you tried some of the natural remedies, like ice packs, compression stockings, or cider vinegar?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Yes. I make sure I do some sort of cardiovascular activity almost every day, like running, biking, or jumping rope. I also use compression stockings for a few hours out of each day, but I'm not sure how long I should wear them."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What kind of stockings do you use, and are you wearing them while you run, walk, or exercise?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I use medical-grade compression stockings that were prescribed by my doctor. I do not use the stockings while I exercise as instructed by my doctor.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Based on the information you’ve provided, it sounds like you need to be wearing the stockings while you exercise, as recommended by your doctor.  It might also help to add some stretching after exercising, since this improves circulation in the leg.  In general, doctors recommend running at least 15 minutes a day for long-term benefit.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'My doctors said that cycling exercises are best for circulation, as it takes the stress off the legs.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It does seem like cycling is a good exercise for you, and it does tend to put less pressure on the legs than running.   Would you be interested in creating a schedule that incorporates cycling and/or walking with your normal cardiovascular activity?  This will ensure you do enough exercise to help your circulation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes. I think creating a daily routine of cardiovascular activity is best for me and my circulation.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Would you like me to help you create a routine?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes. Please help be create a routine for cardiovascular activity everyday.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What types of exercise do you enjoy most?  Are you interested in swimming, dancing, or running?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I enjoy swimming, dancing and running exercises.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I put fondant on a cake?'}]
