DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do mend a broken heart?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can’t, unfortunately, but you can change the way you live your life.  Focusing on being a good person and caring for others is a great way to get past a broken heart.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Its just so painful. I feel like I will never get over it.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Is it a recent break up? Or have you been trying to get over it for a while?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'its fairly recent = a few weeks.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I don’t want to diminish how hard it is to deal with a breakup, but a few weeks isn’t long.  Maybe think about some ways that you can make a positive change in your life, even if you don’t think it’s working, maybe try things out.  And if you have thoughts of suicide, that’s not something to treat lightly, I recommend talking with a therapist about what to do next.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thats great advice. I am not suicidal at all but just heart broken.'}]
