DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you have any suggestions on how to phrase questions to AI?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure I follow. Can you give an example of what you’re trying to ask?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'For example, do certain keywords make it easier for AI to answer a question?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are you looking for words that an AI can use to answer more types of questions, or just to pick out more answerable questions?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think I am asking if AI has a preferred way for a human to ask a question.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In that case, are you looking for a specific language or a special way of formulating a question?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'No to a specific language, but yes to a special way of formulating a question.'}]
