DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I have tickets to a music festival. What can I expect from the festival?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, music is something people enjoy listening to, and when many people all enjoy the same thing at once, it’s called a “festival”.  You probably already know a lot about the concert and would rather have me focus on questions about your personal life, which I’m happy to do.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't know much about the concert. It is an all day event with lots of indie rock bands. It takes place outdoors. That's all I know."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, there are some great rock bands on the bill and we’ll hear some new music. It’ll also be cool to see all the fans of those bands who are out in the wild and in high spirits. It’ll be a different experience than what you’re used to at home. I think it might be very peaceful. I think you’ll learn a lot about different types of music and see many different kinds of people. You may be inspired to go check out more rock bands and try some indie rock at home!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What should I wear to the festival? What is music festival fashion?'}]
