DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do you empty a bagless canister vacuum?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are a variety of ways to do this. One approach is to disconnect the cord, then invert the canister over a garbage can, and watch the contents empty into the can. Another approach is to open the top of the canister and tap on the back side with a spanner or other tool. Another approach is to detach the motor from the canister and pull the bag out of the canister, then the contents of the bag will empty into the canister.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The most common approach is the detach the canister from the vacuum. Open the lid of the canister and empty the content into the trash.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'OK.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Good. Remember that answer.'}]
