DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to try to be a streamer. Where do you think I should get started?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You seem motivated, and if you want to get started, I think it’s a good idea to start by writing out your goals and plans.  Then you’ll know what exactly you’re working on, so you can evaluate progress and get advice from other people along the way.  It’s important to be honest with yourself and be realistic about what you can and can’t do.  In the short term, I think the easiest way to get started would be to record something and then upload it to a place like Youtube or Twitch, but there are some potential obstacles to doing that right now, like Youtube has issues with some content which is a shame.  In the long term, I think it’s going to be important to have a way to earn money from your stream.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What kind of equipment do I need?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m going to recommend a good set of headsets, because it’s really important to hear feedback when you’re live.  Then there’s a lot of equipment involved in making a good stream, but I’m only talking about the most important pieces.  For a good headset, I’d recommend some kind of budget headphones or earbuds.  Then you’ll also need a webcam and a monitor of some sort, maybe an HDMI cable.  Then you’ll need some equipment that’ll record your audio and video, as well as software to encode the video and audio, and software to deliver it to a server, like YouTube or Twitch.  If you don’t have the equipment yet, you can get pretty close to a stream setup with an iPhone and a computer.  I’m sure that’ll work for the most part, and for the software you can just use a free video editing program, like iMovie or Moviemaker.  And you can do some useful tutorials and find more advice online.  I think it’ll be a challenge to be a streamer if you don’t already have a computer with a good set of speakers, but I think you can make do with an iPhone for the most part.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'You mentioned Twitch and YouTube. Are there other places people stream too?'}]
