DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Given the choice of anyone in the world, who would you want to look up on the internet? Why?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Uhhh...  I’m not sure.  There are so many people, and you have to specify what you want to search for them for...?  Do you mean a question about what they’ve done, or maybe just what they’re like?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'good response. It is a very interesting question to ask you. I wan to know what you find interesting. I want to know who you find interesting in the world and why?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh.  I guess I like to read about people who are fighting for the rights of animals.  Like Sea Shepherd.  But also about different organizations that work to improve health in developing countries, and to help people better understand the environment.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sea Shepherd are an organization, not a person. Who specifically do you find interesting and why?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, I like Paul Watson. He’s the captain of the Sea Shepherd ship, the Steve Irwin.  He’s very intelligent and eloquent, and he tries to reason with the fishermen when he’s fighting against them, to make sure that they understand the risks and think about the world they’re affecting.  He feels really strongly about what he does, and he’s really clear about it, and I admire that.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'That is really good to hear. How can I find out more about him?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'If you Google him, you’ll find he’s done a lot of TV interviews, and has a lot of books written about him and Sea Shepherd.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'thank you. Why do you think it is so important to protect the oceans?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The oceans have really important functions in our ecosystem, and in our world.  It’s one of the things that makes our lives sustainable, in ways we don’t fully understand.   The ocean is also a lot of fun, it’s like a huge playground that we don’t use that much.  We have some TV shows that explore the oceans, and some really good books.  There’s a really good book I’d recommend, by Jean Craighead George called My Side of the Mountain.  It’s about a boy who lives in the forest, not far from where I am now.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'He lives in the mountains, not the forest. why would you recommend this book? Is it related to the ocean?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are normal stipulations within an NDA contract?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'An NDA contract is a type of non-disclosure agreement, in which two parties agree to keep a secret or confidential information confidential, and also agree that one side won’t sue the other for failing to keep the secret, in the event of a breach of the NDA.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How long should a NDA be?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The length of the agreement will depend on the complexity of the information in question. It might also depend on whether one side has a strong incentive to disclose the information to others (for example, if it can cause their company significant financial damage) and how likely it is that the information will be shared. If you don’t trust the other party to keep their side of the NDA, it’s generally best to get the other party to sign a one-sided NDA, which you can then use to sue them in case they do break the NDA and give the information to another party.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is it best to have a lawyer look over an NDA?'}]
