DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you eat green tomatoes?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Green tomatoes are a delicious vegetable that can be prepared in a variety of ways.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Great! What are some ways to prepare them/'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Green tomatoes can be eaten uncooked or cooked in any way that you would cook a regular tomato.  Slices can be added to soups, or slices can be roasted or sautéed.  Green tomatoes can also be blended into sauces and salad dressings, or cut into slices and served on sandwiches.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What about fried green tomatoes? What are those?'}]
