DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What can I dip crunchy pretzels in?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I don’t know what crunchy pretzels are, so I don’t know how to prepare them for dipping, but you can dip pretzels in cream cheese, salsa, or peanut butter.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Mm, sounds good. How about sweet options?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In general, most people have trouble getting the crunchy pretzel to stay together, since it’s really soft.  The easiest thing to dip is just pretzels in peanut butter.  But there are also other popular choices.  Popcorn, puffed cereal, granola, pretzel sticks, or even vegetables are all great dipping foods.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Hmm, I want something even sweeter.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'When was the Snickers bar first made?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It was invented by Frank Spencer, Sr. in 1940, in Dayton, Ohio.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What brand has the rights to snickers now?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'They were acquired by Mars Inc. in 1979.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who is the CEO of Mars inc. ?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I make my PC run faster?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Is this computer running Ubuntu?  Are you using a Unity desktop?  Are you thinking of downloading and installing special apps, like a graphics driver?  Is your computer one that’s considered old, like a 5-year-old HP or a 6-year-old Macbook?  It’s okay if you don’t know the answers to these questions.  There are other ways to ask the question.  We could just say “Please figure out which of these things might make your computer run faster”, and just list a bunch of things for you to consider.  In this case, that’s a reasonable strategy for helping you.  Or we could get a little more detailed, and try to be more specific, and ask you how you think these things might impact speed, like “I know a lot of people have the impression that a new graphics card will improve performance, but what do'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "It's a Windows desktop I bought about three years ago. I'm just wondering if there's anything I can do to get it to run faster and cleaner besides upgrading hardware."}]
