DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you have any helpful tips on getting used to wearing sunscreen? I hate the feeling on my skin'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I can think of two things that might help.  One is for you to only wear sunscreen when you are going outside, because that's when you need it.  The other is that once you wear sunscreen you can take it off any time after the sun goes down.  These tricks might be more helpful to you if you can apply them at the start of your outdoor activities rather than when you are about to go out."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Well, yeah I'm aware of this. I hate wearing sunscreen because I feel sticky"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you like wearing sunscreen that’s less sticky?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Well yeah but I can'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m happy to try to find some brands of sunscreen that are less sticky for you.  I know a lot of people who like to apply sunscreen with less stickiness.   I wonder if there are any brands you might be willing to try?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes! Help me'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think that there are also some other ways that you might be able to reduce how sticky sunscreen feels.  What you can try is'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I could try some of those things out. But the moisturizer one, I feel like that would actually make it worse'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Why do you think that?  I’m curious.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Because moisturizers also feel sticky!'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Help me learn about Buddhism, general info about its origins'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Buddhism originated in ancient India about 2500 years ago, and is based on ancient Hinduism.  It’s both a religion and a philosophy, and it stresses human compassion and virtue, with an emphasis on human peace and kindness.  Buddhism is found in many countries and around the world, with one of the largest populations in China.  It’s a major religion in Japan, Sri Lanka, Thailand, Myanmar, Tibet, Korea, Vietnam, and Indonesia.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What do the teachings of Buddhism say?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Buddhism stresses many themes in its teachings, but it can be summarized by a few major ideas:  That a human’s main problem is craving (or lust, or attachment), and that they must work to diminish these attachments;  That a human must turn to compassion as a better way to live than vice or self-hatred;  That people must continually strive to live better lives for themselves and others; and that they must reject the illusions of the world and trust in the Buddha’s teachings for guidance.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So enlightenment of sorts?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the difference between android 9 and android 11?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m afraid I don’t know what those numbers mean. Can you explain more about the context?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "You don't know much about it?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m sorry, but I don’t know what you’re talking about.  Would you mind telling me more about android 9 and 11?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'They are operating systems for cell phones.'}]
