allenges of pregnancy, such as fatigue, nausea, and the need for rest.\n   - Prepare for the emotional changes and the adjustment period of the new parents.\n\n2. **Emotional Support**:\n   - Seek out support systems, including family, friends, or professional counselors.\n   - Consider joining support groups or online communities for new parents to share experiences and get advice.\n\n3. **Financial Planning**:\n   - Consider the financial aspects of parenthood, including health insurance, child care, and the cost of the baby’s care.\n   - Set up an emergency fund and plan for unexpected expenses.\n\n4. **Health and Wellness**:\n   - Consult with your healthcare provider for pre-pregnancy check-ups and to discuss any potential risks']
