DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I make a faucet look streak free?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Try washing it with a soap that doesn’t have high suds, then rinse it with a lot of water.  Another way is to use a soft sponge and sponges don’t make many suds.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I make my faucet look polished?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think you’re looking for something that has a shimmering finish.  You can use various scouring powders to get that effect.  You can also use mild abrasive sponges with no high suds.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's a good idea.  It won't hurt the faucet, right?"}]
