DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do you use a tea diffuser?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, that depends on how you define "use."  I usually use a tea diffuser as a novelty item to generate aromatic water vapor and fragrant scent.  But you can also use a tea diffuser to make iced tea and other kinds of beverages, and there are many different ways of using it.  It\'s up to you to tell me more about your intended usage.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sorry, I meant to say "tea infuser". My mistake. How do you make tea with a tea infuser?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Most tea infusers are designed for a standard 20-ounce pot or mug of water, and provide an average cup of tea with some tea bags.  You can always use a tea infuser with a tea bag, but you can also use tea infusers with loose tea leaves, for very strong tea or large quantities of tea, and also with tea lattes and ice-blended iced tea.  I can also use the tea infuser to make iced tea, iced coffee, lattes and milk shakes.  We might want to experiment together to see what kinds of beverages you would like to try, and we can make the tea infuser work for us.  For example, if you like regular black tea, you could experiment with the tea infuser to see how strong a'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Answer was too long. You need to keep it brief.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'm sorry, I'll try to keep things as brief as possible.  We were just talking about how to use a tea infuser.  One way to use a tea infuser is to make iced tea with it.  Another way to use a tea infuser is to make milkshakes.  Another way to use a tea infuser"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't think you can make milkshake with a tea infuser."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I find new pop music on Spotify?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'How is this a challenge for me?  You should be able to do this with Google.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I actually want to do it on Spotify. Is there a way to search for it on the app?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Just click “New” and type in the artist name you’re looking for.  You can do it from the main menu as well.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Okay. I don't want a specific artist, just the genre to be pop music."}]
