in.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Are these other people people you are creating?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes. They will be patients of the psychiatrist.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want to include the psychiatrist?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'In the story, yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want to have the psychiatrist as part of the story, as a major character?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'How would you like her to relate to the other characters?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think mostly she is treating the victims.'}]
