DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I like going to Starbucks at times. Right now, I wanna make one of their drinks at home. Do you know the steps of how I can make a Starbucks salted caramel mocha?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m happy to help you learn how to make a Starbucks Salted Caramel Mocha. My goal is to give you high-quality advice and resources, and I am ready to help you achieve your goal. Would you like me to help you with that?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, please.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'When making a mocha, you will need the following ingredients: coffee (whole bean or ground) syrup (sugar and water) salt (usually table salt or sea salt) milk (whole milk, 2% milk, or skim milk) whipped cream (from a can) ice and an espresso machine. I also recommend that you use a glass cup for presentation purposes. You can also pick a garnish, such as whipped cream and/or sprinkles or chocolate shavings.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay lets go slow. First, what are the ingredients for the mocha sauce in the drink?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The ingredients for the mocha sauce are sugar, water and salt.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Well, its actually sugar, water and cocoa powder'}]
