DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'what are some good vegetarian pizza toppings?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It depends on how much variety you’re looking for. Some vegetarian pizzas are topped with Italian herbs, olives, mushrooms, peppers, or other similar things. Some popular vegan pizzas use vegetables like tomato sauce, mozzarella, and other cheese, mushrooms, and other vegetables.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'any others?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you help me understand why Pluto is no longer a planet?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I can try.  It’s been nearly twenty years since the International Astronomical Union (IAU) decided that Pluto no longer met the criteria for being a planet, and since then, humanity has still not resolved how they want to categorize it.  To make matters more complicated, there are multiple groups that have recently been arguing that “Planet Nine” exists, but who knows how long it will take to decide whether or not they were right.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are the criteria for being a planet?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There’s a set of rules and definitions that are used to categorize objects like planets.  For example, a planet must have cleared the neighborhood around its orbit, and this is to make sure we don’t accidentally add other objects into the planet category like asteroids or space debris.  Also, a planet must be massive enough that it doesn’t just orbit the sun but that it is in a separate orbit and thus not affected by the sun’s gravity.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "So what was it about Pluto that didn't fit the criteria?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm looking for a warm place to travel! Where would you recommend?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Does listening to music help your workout?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This is a question that’s not totally straightforward to answer.  It’s a good question for a subject-matter expert to answer.  Music can help the mood of exercise, especially in physical activity where a goal is being accomplished, which may motivate the individual.  But if you have an audio track that is forcing you to move, or moving you too quickly, it may end up hindering you more than helping.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So it may be helpful but it may hurt you?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some activities I can have at a pool party?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'When people say “pool party”, they often mean a lot of different things.  “Pool” can refer to the big rectangular pool, or the small rectangular pool, or the round pool.  “Party” can mean a big party with lots of people, a small party with just a few people, or an intimate party with just a couple of people.  There’s no way to be sure how you want to interpret it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "okay well it's going to be a big pool, for my daughter's 6th birthday."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great!  If you’re inviting people over to play, what would be a good thing to play?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I was hoping you could help me with that.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In the past, people have played “pool volleyball”, which is usually played at a pool.  In other circumstances people have played “silly putty”.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'how can you play silly putty in a pool?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I really have appreciated the work of James Gandolfini. What are some of his works, outside of the main series he was famous for?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'He was known for the main series, “The Sopranos”, but his work went beyond that.  He was in another television series called “The Jersey” that was an HBO show that focused on the New Jersey Mafia.  Here is a trailer:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Looks like you got some of that right, but I can't find the reference on the Jersey. Can you be more specific, or did you make that up?"}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want to try to be a streamer. Where do you think I should get started?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You seem motivated, and if you want to get started, I think it’s a good idea to start by writing out your goals and plans.  Then you’ll know what exactly you’re working on, so you can evaluate progress and get advice from other people along the way.  It’s important to be honest with yourself and be realistic about what you can and can’t do.  In the short term, I think the easiest way to get started would be to record something and then upload it to a place like Youtube or Twitch, but there are some potential obstacles to doing that right now, like Youtube has issues with some content which is a shame.  In the long term, I think it’s going to be important to have a way to earn money from your stream.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What kind of equipment do I need?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m going to recommend a good set of headsets, because it’s really important to hear feedback when you’re live.  Then there’s a lot of equipment involved in making a good stream, but I’m only talking about the most important pieces.  For a good headset, I’d recommend some kind of budget headphones or earbuds.  Then you’ll also need a webcam and a monitor of some sort, maybe an HDMI cable.  Then you’ll need some equipment that’ll record your audio and video, as well as software to encode the video and audio, and software to deliver it to a server, like YouTube or Twitch.  If you don’t have the equipment yet, you can get pretty close to a stream setup with an iPhone and a computer.  I’m sure that’ll work for the most part, and for the software you can just use a free video editing program, like iMovie or Moviemaker.  And you can do some useful tutorials and find more advice online.  I think it’ll be a challenge to be a streamer if you don’t already have a computer with a good set of speakers, but I think you can make do with an iPhone for the most part.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'You mentioned Twitch and YouTube. Are there other places people stream too?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yeah there are, but the most popular are Twitch and YouTube.  There’s also a paid platform called Blip, which I think is for pro-gamers.  It’s more expensive than the others, though.  Twitch also has a “creator’s program”, where they sell streamer subscriptions.  The problem is they sell access to more of the pro players, and I don’t think you can become a pro streamer overnight, so I don’t think this option is for you.  But there’s also a free plan on Twitch, so that’s still a good option.  When you stream on YouTube, you need to be at least 15 and have a user account to do that.  Twitch also has a link for the free version in their “streaming advice” section.  I think it’s pretty easy to stream, especially on Twitch.  I’ll definitely help you in whatever way I can to get started!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's a lot to think about, but thanks for all the info."}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "My brother has become addicted to gambling and I'm not sure how to help him. Any advice?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Hm, sounds like a big issue. Gambling can really cause a lot of harm in a person’s life, and many other health problems.  I can see two ways to address this. One is just to talk to him, and try to get him to see that he's not being responsible for his own actions. I'm not sure I'm really good at making people see that though. The other thing I think might work is to change his environment so that he's not tempted. Maybe that would help?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do most people who are addicted to gambling get help? Just therapy or something?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "The most common way of treating gambling addiction in the US is by attending a 12 step program. These are places like AA and Gamblers Anonymous, where people go and talk about how they were caught in the addiction and find their way back to a healthier lifestyle. Some people do have counseling to go with that, but I don't know exactly how common that is."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I see. I will try and talk him into enrolling in a program then.'}]
