DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'If I was going to become a fan of NFL football, what team would be the best team to root for?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, you’re just messing with me right now.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'No, really. Which team is the most likely to not break my heart?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, is that your real question? Ok, I guess the Arizona Cardinals are really good at not breaking people’s hearts.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What gives you that idea?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Well, they’ve never won a Super Bowl. That’s the thing that breaks people’s hearts the most.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The truth hurts.'}]
