DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I'm looking for a new desktop computer"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sounds good! What are you looking for in a computer, what would you like it to do? What would be most important to you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I need to use it for school as well as work. So it would need to have a lot of storage and a good sized screen. i also want to be able to connect it to a second monitor'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Hm, sounds like you're interested in a decently large computer, with plenty of storage. You want to be able to easily use your computer for both work and school, and want it to be able to handle connecting to a second monitor. Do you think you might be interested in something with a touchscreen as well?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't need a touchscreen"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I see. It sounds like you have a preference for not using a touchscreen. That makes sense, it's a pretty popular technology that can be very useful. You might also be interested in the Mac, or perhaps a PC laptop, since they're the two popular options right now. It can be helpful to try to think about what you'll want to use your computer for at home, at work, and at school, since that will determine which products are right for you.  You may also want to think about whether or not you want to be able to do video editing, or design things like 3d graphics."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I was thinking about a Mac but they seem to be extremely expensive.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Oh, there are both Macs and PCs that are affordable. I could help you look around for deals, if you're interested. Both are popular, which tends to mean that they're easier to find in terms of price and availability. Are you in the market for a new laptop, or a desktop computer?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I would like a new desktop. What kind of prices are there for mac desktops?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "It looks like there are both Windows PCs and Macs in the $500-$1500 price range. So it sounds like those would be in the ballpark of what you're looking for. Macs are a bit more expensive, so if you were thinking about a PC I would help you look around. I can also make a list of the best deals for you to look through, if you'd like. The Mac doesn't seem to be much more expensive than the PCs right now."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Could you help me find the best deals for a Mac?'}]
