role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think the first song we should look at is Elvis Costello’s “Pills and Soap”.  I think it’s a great song to start with, because it has a strong beat, and some nice changes in the melody, which is a very good way to start a mix tape.  I think it would work well with some of the other songs.  For instance, Van Morrison’s “Don’t Worry About a Thing” has the same sort of driving beat and powerful melody.  Do you think this song would be a good addition?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes this is a good start. thank you.'}]
