DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'if my child has a disability but has not realized it yet should i tell her?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "This is a good question, because disabilities do affect people's ability to function in society.  People with disabilities are not treated the same as people without disabilities.  That is, in some cases people who have a disability have fewer rights or opportunities.  It can be really hard for people with disabilities to find work, get an education, or stay in their homes.  I think it is really important for people to know they have a right to equal treatment and opportunities, so it is good for them to know their rights."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So should i be honest and tell her, or just tell mer be?'}]
