DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "I see a lot of peoples' names in movie credits for jobs like best boy, grip, and camera operator. How many different aspects go into making a movie?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m going to try to break this down for you.  The people who are in the movie industry are called “filmmakers”. They all work in different jobs, like directing, producing, shooting, writing, editing, etc.  You see a lot of movie credits for a lot of different people because, as I understand it, every step of the process requires more people, and more skills.  So you’d have people who are involved in the writing of the script, the filming of the movie, the editing, etc.  Even though there is only one “movie”, it takes a lot of different people working in different skills to make a movie, and therefore it takes a lot of people to have their name mentioned in the credits.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you tell me more about what producing a movie entails?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, let me break this down for you:  When people are “producing” a movie, they’re deciding where, and when, and how, and who, the movie is going to be made.  The people who are in charge of that decision-making process are called “producers”.  Producing a movie involves coordinating the actors, directors, and crew to create the scenes of the movie, and then making sure they are recorded and are good quality, and that they fit the story that is written.  There are a lot of different roles in the movie-making process, and each one is very important.  I imagine that there are a lot of different ways to be a good producer.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'So a producer works before, during, and after shooting a movie?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Why doesn't he talk to me anymore"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I don’t have any context, so I’m not really sure what you’re asking.  Maybe you want to tell me who you’re talking about?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I used to talk to a guy and saw him a few times. Now he won't talk to me"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, I think I understand.  You might be having a hard time because you haven’t spoken in a while, and the other person feels that you have dropped out of the conversation.  Is that what’s happening?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Kind of. His family said I was too old for him so he dumped me'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh no!  That’s terrible. I’m sorry to hear that.  How old was he?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '27 and I was 40'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Wow. I’m so sorry.  Do you think that made a difference?  If you don’t mind my asking, what are your own age preferences, if any?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I usually do not date younger so he was the first one for me'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'OK.  I can understand that it can be hard to find someone to date.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think I would like to stay single'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': "Hey, I'm wondering how to find free mental health resources? I'd really like to enroll in therapy but it's not in the budget and I don't know where to start"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Yes, it's really a question of need and priority.   Do you think you could just do some light reading on the subject? If you tell me more about what your current situation is like I might be able to point you in a direction."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I have been trying to do more reading and podcasts and journaling, but I think a therapist would be helpful as I am in a position where I have finally left a lifetime abuser'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "There is definitely a lot of ground to cover. There are many free resources available on the web, but it may be difficult to make sense of them.   I think I could help you find what's appropriate and relevant.  I will do this by pairing you with an in-person therapist with expertise in helping you with your particular concerns and goals."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thanks! How do you pair me with a therapist?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'll explain the process in more detail.   The exact steps depend on your location.   We'll need to take a few things into account.  First, there are different types of therapists and so we have to make sure we pair you with the one that best fits your specific needs."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Go ahead!'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Once we know what type of therapy you want, then we can find a therapist in your area.  We can start by asking what type of therapy you'd like to try.  For instance, maybe you would like to try a different kind of therapy like cognitive behavioral therapy, or dialectical behavioral therapy, or group therapy, or meditation."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I'd like to try trauma therapy"}]
