DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I took my car to be inspected and the mechanic told me it needed a new alternator. What is an alternator and what does it do?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'An alternator is a part of your car’s electrical system that supplies current to various devices in your car, including the radio, lighting, and power to start the engine. Your alternator also recharges your car’s battery.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How important is the alternator?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The alternator is a critical part of your car’s system. If your car’s battery dies, you may not be able to start your car, or the car may not work correctly, like the lights and radio. The alternator is one of the most important parts of your car.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is it a difficult task to replace it myself?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'There are many different brands of alternators, so it is hard to give an absolute answer. The part you need is a very standard part, and one that you could obtain from many different automotive parts stores. If you decide to replace it yourself, I suggest taking the following precautions:'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you for those useful tips.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do you become a certified automotive mechanic?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You probably already know how to diagnose problems with your car, and can work on its engine or other systems. That’s a good start. Then you’ll need to take a comprehensive exam in automotive theory, then test your real-world skills by performing a series of more and more difficult tasks in a simulated setting. After that, you’ll receive a Certificate of Automotive Maintenance Excellence from the National Institute for Automotive Service Excellence.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. Can you list all of the specific requirements to get the Certificate?'}]
