DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What do I need to start a podcast?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You’ll need a computer, an internet connection, and a microphone.  You might also want to figure out where you want to livestream from, and the URL of your website.  Do you have any existing knowledge or interest in the content you plan to talk about?  What do you hope to achieve by starting a podcast?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes. I want to have a podcast that talks about new things people never learned. I want the podcast to be on Apple and have a new one every week. How does livestream work?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can stream from anywhere you have access to a good internet connection.  You’ll need to make sure that your microphone is working, then you can just record into the microphone and press record, and you’ll be able to record straight into your microphone.  Then you’ll need to upload the audio to your website and promote it on social media.   It’s a long process, but pretty easy once you’re good with it.   Do you have any questions?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay. I was wanting to actually record it so any errors could be edited out. Is that easy to do?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Yes, it is pretty easy to do! It might seem like a time-consuming process, but you’ll get better at it as you go, and it’ll get easier. You just need to make sure to edit all of the audio from the microphones, and not just the part you want people to hear.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the best microphone to get for a podcast?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'It’s kind of a personal preference. Some people like using mics with an audio input plug, so that you can connect to the input of your computer, while other people prefer using an external mic stand or to plug the mic directly into the computer’s microphone port.  There are also all kinds of styles of microphone stands and some even attach to your computer for easy streaming.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Is it the same with the webcams? I'd like to also put the podcasts on my website with video of everyone talking."}]
