DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am trying to write a fairy tale. What is the most popular plot?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The most popular plot might be “a princess goes to a faraway land, falls in love, and has a magic genie that grants her wishes”.  We can find plenty of examples of this if we search for fairy tales using the search engine Google.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "You can't look anything up on google."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'OK, so let’s think about some other popular fairy tales.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you like the plot of Hansel and Gretel?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Not particularly.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what don't you like?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I feel like the children do very stupid things.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Should I include a witch on my story?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think a witch is a fairly common fairy tale element, so yes.  However, what kind of plotline would you like to pursue?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I was thinking I might pursue a feminist plot for a more modern fairytale.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would be happy to help you make your story a more feminist one.  Are you writing a new story, or retelling a traditional one?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think it would be nice to redo a traditional fairytale and make it feminist.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want me to help you identify parts of the original fairy tale that you would like to modernize?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great! Can you tell me a little bit more about the story that you want to retell?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think I want to retell snow white.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, that’s a classic!   Have you seen the Disney movie?  It’s very romantic.   It tells the story of how a beautiful princess gets married to a charming prince.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes, except I think I want to have the prince character take the place of the snow white character.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Gotcha.   So, how does this relate to the plot of the traditional fairy tale?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The prince would be stuck in the woods hiding from the witch and waiting for a princess to come for him.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This would be a really interesting modern retelling.   Would the witch in the new version be a “toxic feminist” or “man hater”?  Or something else?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The witch could be trying to make the prince give up his traditionally female characteristics and turn him into a bad person.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This sounds like a really interesting modern retelling of the story!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How should I remake the characters of the seven dwarves?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I wonder what they represent in the original story.   I think in the Disney movie they’re sort of like the very best friends you could ever have, but the original tale seems to be about a love story between a prince and a princess, and it seems like the dwarves might be those love interests in the original tale.   Is that right?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think they are friends. Perhaps the seven dwarves could just be seven friends the prince has?'}]
