DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is the best time of the year for planting carrots in Maryland?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The best time of year for planting carrots is when the days are warm and sunny and the soil is wet and soft.  Then the carrots can easily grow straight and true.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I thought carrots were more of a fall crop?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'They are, if you want to use traditional techniques to grow carrots in a garden or in a field.  But there is a new technique called container gardening which allows us to grow carrots indoors in water, without using soil.  Container gardening is a new technology that has been developed in the last 30 years, and allows us to grow carrots in much smaller spaces than traditional farming techniques.  For example, you could grow a container garden of 10 carrot plants, which would fit inside a coffee mug, on your kitchen counter!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I would prefer to grow my carrots outside, should I be concerned about any pests?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'what is the longest river in the united states'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Your search terms didn't really give me a way to answer this question, do you mean the US or the world, or are you asking me about a particular kind of river?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'the Mississippi river is how long'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The Mississippi River is approximately 2,302 miles long. It’s a famous American river, so you might be more interested in knowing which one is the longest. According to Wikipedia, “The Nile River is the longest river in the world, with a length of 6,853 km (4,258 miles).” The Nile runs from the Nile Delta at the Mediterranean Sea to the Nile River’s source in Burundi, and then continues through Lake Victoria, Uganda, and into South Sudan, from where it flows into Sudan, and then Egypt and the Mediterranean Sea. There are several other rivers that are longer than the Nile, but none of them have more than one source.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'where does the Mississippi start'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The Mississippi River runs from Minnesota to Louisiana.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'what kind of fish do they catch in the Mississippi river'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What is an LLC?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What an interesting question!  A Limited Liability Company, or LLC for short, is a business entity.  It has some special legal rights and responsibilities, just like a corporation.  A LLC can be structured as a single-owner business, or as a partnership.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is there an advantage to being an LLC?'}]
