DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How often should you wash your hair?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That’s a trick question, you can do whatever you want!  Although washing your hair regularly has been recommended to reduce dandruff and greasy hair, I wouldn’t go crazy and spend a lot of time washing it every day.  Also if you’re healthy, you should have clean water available to you to wash it with.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't want to wash it every day. It dries it out. How often do you think?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'How about every second day?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think maybe every second day may work. I was wondering if there was a generally accepted time on the internet?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Most commonly you’ll see people recommend washing it every 2-3 days, but you’ll see conflicting advice about how long that is.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Ok thank you.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some of the best podcasts to listen to?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not an expert on podcasts, but I know that there are lots of popular podcasts. I would recommend taking a look at their descriptions and titles on a website like https://www.iTunes.com/podcasts/. There are also lots of new podcasts coming out every day, so I’m not sure which ones are the “best”. Is there a specific type of podcast you’re looking for? Maybe we could look at those more specifically?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I don't have an iphone or any apple products. Can you give me another way to find podcasts or maybe you can name a few popular podcasts."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I think the world is much bigger than just podcasts, but what kind of “podcasts” do you mean? There are other types of podcasts like news podcasts, gaming podcasts, and academic podcasts.  Would you like some suggestions?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Can you recommend a gaming podcast?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some little ways I can save money in my daily life?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would suggest turning off the lights in your house when you leave, and you might as well leave the heat off when you aren’t there.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's a good idea. What about when I'm not at home?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Well, you can still turn off all the lights when you're gone, and the heat, too. Also, you can set the thermostat lower while you're away. Or even lower! That'll save on your heating bill. But be careful - a too-low temperature will make your pipes freeze. If your pipes freeze, you'll need to call a plumber to thaw them out, which costs money."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How can I save money on food?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am trying to write a fairy tale. What is the most popular plot?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The most popular plot might be “a princess goes to a faraway land, falls in love, and has a magic genie that grants her wishes”.  We can find plenty of examples of this if we search for fairy tales using the search engine Google.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "You can't look anything up on google."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'OK, so let’s think about some other popular fairy tales.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Do you like the plot of Hansel and Gretel?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Not particularly.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "what don't you like?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I feel like the children do very stupid things.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Should I include a witch on my story?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think a witch is a fairly common fairy tale element, so yes.  However, what kind of plotline would you like to pursue?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I was thinking I might pursue a feminist plot for a more modern fairytale.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I would be happy to help you make your story a more feminist one.  Are you writing a new story, or retelling a traditional one?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think it would be nice to redo a traditional fairytale and make it feminist.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Do you want me to help you identify parts of the original fairy tale that you would like to modernize?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great! Can you tell me a little bit more about the story that you want to retell?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think I want to retell snow white.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Oh, that’s a classic!   Have you seen the Disney movie?  It’s very romantic.   It tells the story of how a beautiful princess gets married to a charming prince.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes, except I think I want to have the prince character take the place of the snow white character.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Gotcha.   So, how does this relate to the plot of the traditional fairy tale?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The prince would be stuck in the woods hiding from the witch and waiting for a princess to come for him.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This would be a really interesting modern retelling.   Would the witch in the new version be a “toxic feminist” or “man hater”?  Or something else?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'The witch could be trying to make the prince give up his traditionally female characteristics and turn him into a bad person.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This sounds like a really interesting modern retelling of the story!'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How should I remake the characters of the seven dwarves?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I wonder what they represent in the original story.   I think in the Disney movie they’re sort of like the very best friends you could ever have, but the original tale seems to be about a love story between a prince and a princess, and it seems like the dwarves might be those love interests in the original tale.   Is that right?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I think they are friends. Perhaps the seven dwarves could just be seven friends the prince has?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Sure, I think that sounds good!   What do you think the seven dwarves represent?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'They are named after personality traits or moods mostly, so I think each friend could be overtly different in a specific way.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think that would work really well for a story about having friends as the main focus.   Is there a specific person you would like to have as one of the seven dwarves?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "I can't think of a popular person to use as a character. Can you?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think we should start by creating the seven dwarves individually, then think about who might fit into each of the roles.  I think for the first one, we could use someone like Elvis.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'probably not Elvis but its a good thought.'}]
