DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'how do i start with subsistence farming?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'The first step is to define what “subsistence farming” means to you.   What is your ideal way of life? What is the highest quality of life you desire? What are the skills and resources you’ll need to achieve that quality of life?   Once you’ve defined these, start trying to acquire the skills and resources you’ll need.  Don’t worry too much about having every skill and resource from the start; that won’t be realistic.  What’s realistic is trying to set your sights high, and then working your way towards that.  Even if your initial goal is modest, it will help you set your own goals higher in the future, and it’ll help you build skills that will be applicable to other goals later on.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, well, I want to be able to make most of my food from my backyard.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Let me help you rephrase that.  I know that’s probably not the wording that you want to use, but I want to give you an example of what it means to create a quality of life that you desire.  So what are the skills and resources you’ll need to achieve your dream of subsistence farming?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I was hoping you could help me with that.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m glad you asked.  Let’s look at it like this:  you’ve already identified the goal, which is subsistence farming.  That means you can grow or produce just about everything you need to eat, except for one thing.  Do you know what that one thing is?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'what?'}]
