DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some cute dress up items for girls?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Girls often like to pretend they are wearing fancy dresses.  A nice long skirt is very typical.  To make your voice more of a sweet princess voice, I recommend speaking up, and adding a little bit of excitement to your speech.  In my experience, girls like it when you smile and say “like”, “ya know”, “so”, and other things that make it sound like you are engaged with the girl.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'anything else?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I don’t have any other ideas.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That can't be it."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I apologize that I don’t have anything better.  For men, it’s also popular to pretend to be super fancy.  For a guy, a big hat and a cane are also good.  It’s good to match what the girl is wearing, so a high-waisted pants are good for a princess, and maybe a crown as well.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Seems very gender stereotypical'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I am trying to cut back on my alcohol consumption. Do you have any tips?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m not sure what the best approach is to cutting back on your alcohol consumption.  Let me give it a shot. I think the best way to do this would be to start out trying to limit your alcohol intake on a particular day.  A good idea would be to look at the typical amount of alcohol that you drink and then try to drink that much, or a little bit less, on one day.  That should get you started.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "That's a good idea. How do I politely decline alcohol when offered at parties?"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You could say “I’m in recovery” or “I’m cutting back”. You could also say “I’m driving, so I can’t drink.” You could also say “I’m trying to lose weight, so I’m avoiding alcohol.”'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Those are good suggestions. Can you suggest a good mocktail for when I want beverage without alcohol?'}]
