DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is broccoli good for you?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'This depends on whether you mean “good” in terms of health benefits or in terms of taste.  Broccoli is very healthy, because it’s high in nutrients and low in calories.  But some people don’t like the taste, and think it’s bland or bitter.  And some people are allergic to broccoli, so they can’t eat it at all.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please tell me what vitamins are in broccoli?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Broccoli is very high in vitamins C and K, which are beneficial for the body.  And it also contains vitamin A, which is particularly good for eye health.  Broccoli also contains vitamin B6 and potassium, which are both also very good for you.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Is it the best vegetable in terms of nutrients?'}]
