DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I deal with being cyberbullied?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Cyberbullying is when someone uses electronic means to say mean or negative things about another person.  There are different ways to handle it.  You can tell the person not to do it again, or to stop commenting on posts in which you’re mentioned.  Or you can block them on social media or take down posts they’ve made on your page.  You could also report it to the site you’re using, and ask them to ban the person.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I deal with being doxed?'}]
