DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I safely use a nail gun?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Does this appear to be the right nail gun for the job?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes, it seems fine to me. Do I just load the nails and press it against the wood?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Right, but before you fire it you have to make sure it is loaded and that there are no nails that are pointing at your face. Can I ask you to let me help you?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sure, I have safety glasses ready to wear for eye protection.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Great.  So next, we need to make sure the nail gun is ready to shoot.  It sounds like the gun is ready to go.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Now just press it flat against the wood, right?'}]
