DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How do I ease a mosquito bite?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I think there’s a medicine called “calamine” that you can put on the wound, which is effective for mosquito bites.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay, any other things I can put on it?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I know you’re worried about the sting and the itch, so if it’s possible to put something cool on the bite, that will likely soothe the inflammation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'All right, like what?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'You can apply a cool wet cloth, or put a hand on it to cool it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Any other kinds of ointments I can use?'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'How heavy can a carry-on bag be on domestic flights?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'According to this map of international baggage weight limits, domestic flights from the USA to Mexico usually allow for 23 kg of carry-on baggage.  So yes, a carry-on bag can be quite heavy, depending on what is in it.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'How many pounds is 23 kg?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'In imperial units, a kilogram is 2.2 pounds. So the number you’re looking for is 2.2 x 23 = 48.4 pounds.  It is certainly possible for someone to carry a bag with 48 pounds of items in it on a domestic flight, in the United States.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you very much for your assistance.'}]
DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'I need advice on which game console to buy'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Please describe the console options to me'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Well I could get the Playstation 5 or the new Xbox series X or a nintendo switch'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I see, that’s a tough choice. Let’s see if I can help you by answering a few more questions...'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Okay go ahead'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'What are you looking for in a console?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I want great performance and to play the newest games with my friends'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I see, great performance is good, especially for playing in multiplayer.  Are you more of a solo player or do you like to play games with a bunch of friends?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I definitely prefer playing with friends'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Got it, and what do you like about the newest games?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'I like the amazing graphics and immersive experiences'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'A lot of people like the graphics of newer games and the immersive experiences are nice too, but what about the story?  Do you want to play games with a story and strong characters?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Yes that is important too'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alright, how often do you play these games?  Do you play them every week or just now and then?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Nearly every day'}]
