DIALOGUE PAIRS: [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'What are some alternatives to turkey for thanksgiving?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Alternative meats are a great option.  For Thanksgiving, I’d suggest replacing some turkey with either chicken, lamb, or maybe even duck.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Oh, interesting! Which would be your alternative of choice?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I’m thinking maybe chicken or duck for turkey alternatives.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'What does duck taste like?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'That depends, it can be rich and savory, or even gamey.  My mom makes a lot of recipes with duck meat in them.  But it is very tasty.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Hmm, I don't like gamey. Maybe I will go for chicken."}]
